<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="h">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="imt">Icubu I cikarigo</para>
  <para style="ip">Buna bu hilange cikarigo ci laco ize i buba Matiyu, <char style="bk" closed="false">Bware busa Buyahude, busa Almajiri a Yesu. Cina ci zwame na Kristi Yesu asa bucagago buna aba i alkawali buba na alkawali, bube hinda Yahudawa haba tane soo na bware . Alkawali ani ci sa zwam hayahudawa haba haba ihuga̱ ina aba mace Bware, ama zwam doone ka̱mu.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk" closed="false">A kimuga utakada u Matiyu na burya̠. </char>
    <char style="bk" closed="false">A rwage na maco u Yesu, Baptisma na igwaju, ibwana i bware izwamago, icibago na ihwingacumo i mahuna na Galili. Ban na uni a i cikarigo ci cihano ci Yesu na Galili korwo Urshalima hinda ibwana i Yesu na sati an a kundagi, ilagano i bware na u'o na wasingewa i bware pa aco na a kwaji.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="ip">Utakada u cibe Yesu asa walami a labe, bware buza koce, u buba bui ciba ga cikarigo ci Hwinsu hinda bu cibage cikarigo ci cigwama ci Hwinsu. A tanaga̱ icibago i bware hasala hata: (1) icibago na ogo, ona̱ u cibe nga̱ saawo si Hwinsu siba si madale na doone (2) A za icibagu alagano Kristi aba aza ibwana na yaba (3) Hinda aza icibago ina hamisali dinyiya nga̱ cugwama ci Hwinsu cibe yina (4) Hinda aza icibagu ina cibe nga̱ alagano aba madala na aco doone. (5) Icibago ihogu u doone na korwo u cugwama ci Hwinsu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Usali u Yesu Masihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Utakada u usuli u Yesu Kristi bwa bu Dauda, bwa bu Ibrahim:<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibrahim ibe isa buca bu Ishaku,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:2">Ishaku ibe isa buca̱ bu Yakub,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:2">Yakub buca̱ bu Yahuda na hun bware,<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yahuda ibe isa buca̱ bu Peresa na Zera,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:3">Itamar ibe isa amaci aba, Peresa ibe isa buca bu</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:3">Hezron hinda ibe isa buca̱ bu Aram,<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Aram abe asa buca̱ bu</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:4">Amminadab buca̱ bu Nashon buca̱ bu Salmon,<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salmon hinda asa buca̱ bu</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:5">Bowaz,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:5">Rahab ibe isa amaci a Bowaz buca̱ bu Obida, buna bu</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:5">Irutu iba i mace, Obida ube usa buca̱ bu Yesse,<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Hinda Yesse ibe isa buca̱ bu Dauda Bugwama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 1:6" />
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:6">Dauda abe asa buca̱ bu Sulemanu buna bu amaci aba asa bu'a bu Yuriya,<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Sulemanu abe asa buca̱ bu Rehobowam,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:7">Rehobowam abe asa buca̱ bu Abiya, Abiya abe asa buca̱ bu Asa,<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa abe asa buca̱ bu Yehoshapat,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehoshapat abe asa buca̱ bu Yoram, Yoram abe asa buca̱ bu Yuziya,<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Yuziya abe asa buca̱ bu Yotam, Yotam abe asa buca̱ bu Ahaz, Ahaz abe asa buca̱ bu Hezekaya,<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekaya abe asa buca̱ bu Manasse, Manasse abe asa buca̱ bu Amon, Amon abe asa buca̱ bu Yosiya,<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosiya abe asa buca̱ bu Yekoniya na hun bware, ana aba huga aco Yahuda cigyama korwo cinge ci Babila cigyama.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Nga̱ aba a gi cigyama Babila, Yekoniya abe a mace Sheyaltiyel, Sheyaltiyel abe asa buca̱ bu Zerubabel,<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabel abe asa buca̱ bu Abihudu, Abihudu abe asa buca̱ bu Eliyakim, Eliyakim asa buca̱ bu Azor,<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azor abe asa buca̱ bu Zadok, Zadok abe asa buca bu Akim, Akim abe asa buca̱ bu Eliyud.<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliyud abe asa buca̱ bu Eleyazar, Eleyazar abe asa buca̱ bu Matan, Matan mabe ma mace Yakub<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakub abe asa buca̱ bu Yusuf bware bu Imaryamu, Imaryamu mabe ma mace Yesu ana aba yiwa ne oge Kristi.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Ka̱mu azwaga Ibrahim korwo Dauda, sizwaga ikupe na ha nasi. Dauda korwo hun na aba hugasi aco Isra'ila cigyama korwo cinge ci Babila, sizwaga ikupe na si nasi hinda sizwaga ikupe na si nasi cigyama na Babila korwo maco Kristi.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maco u Yesu Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Harbuni maco u Yesu kristi uba yiwa: Amaci a bware Imaryamu, Yusuf abe a zabi nya̱, kapi bware bu zabi nya̱, kwa aba ni magal ne ba na mukabo mu a̱huru a burya̠. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Zwam Yusuf asa buco bu nagu magwata̱ a karuwo a pan nya̱ mu'nya̱ pa aco, bware bu ma'ila na soo u bware bu a̱ce nya̱ sa na cidaka̱ ca aco.<verse eid="MAT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Bware ni wugi na soo, kwa bucuma bu Hwinsu ne silta bware na halabuwa kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Yusuf, bwa bu Dauda, ta huga iwasa zanga Imaryamu korwo i yaba nibui, isa bu'a abubo. Ina yiwa na mukaba̱ mu iba isa a̱huru a burya̠.<verse eid="MAT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />I mace bwa, goo zane bu ize Yesu, zwam bware bui caga aco buba pa magwata̱ ma ba.<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ka̱mu ina aba zwame ai sinji ina cikarigo ci Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu buba zwamage pa Acubago a Hwinsu: <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />&lt;&lt;Ikangaza ina i dakuwo buco bu cware i sigi mukaba̱ i mace bwa, a zane bo ize Imanuwel.&gt;&gt; ma'an ma Imanuwel, &lt;&lt;Hwinsu yiwa na gaci&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Nga̱ Yusuf aba a hargya malabo, kwa bware ni ia̱ nga̱ bucuma bu Hwinsu buba zwama bware ana bu zangi Imaryamu ni yaba i sa bu'a bu bware.<verse eid="MAT 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Bware bwa si tabuwa i labuta ne iba hal korwo maco bwa buiba. Kwa Yusufu ne tana Bwa ize Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Korwo aco cidaka̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />A mace Yesu na i'ogo i Baitalami ina i yiwa usala u Yahudiya, na uya uni Hiridus abe asa bugwama. Kwa aco na za cidaka̱ ci muginga ne kore Urshalima, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Kwa ne kaba̱ na̱, &lt;&lt;Humba Bwa buna aba mace buna bui sana bugwama bu Yahudawa? Ci hyan igingaa i buba ina ya sirya̱ zata, ci kore ci pa Bware cilabe&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Nga̱ bugwama Hiridus buba huge haruni, soo u buba kwa na masinga, harbuni na aco na yiwa na Urshalima. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Kwa buba ne tanagana alabe labe na hawalami ha icibago i cikarigo ci Musa kwa ne kaba̱ na ga, &lt;&lt;Hunba aba a̱i mace Kristi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Kwa aba ni hin, &lt;&lt;Na i'ogo i Baitalami, u Yahudiya,&gt;&gt; A cane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:5">&lt;Zwam harbuni bucubago bu Hwinsu buba hin: <verse eid="MAT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />&lt;Goo ma Baitalami i'ogo i Yahuda, buta sa bu noya pa aco cugwama ci Yahudiya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">zwam suwa nibui bugwama buba bui sire buna bui sana buhubo bu aco Isra'ila.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Kwa Hiridus ne oga aco cidaka̱ ne ciswin nga̱ bware buba bui daki hon na aba hyan igingaa. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Kwa ne cumana ga korwo Baitalami kwa ni hin: &lt;&lt;Kulije i byan bwa buni na burya̠, si i hyan bo, ga̱hi kurya ini zwama, nga̱ gya ma ne kore pana bo cilabe. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Nga̱ aba hogi ihuge cikarigo ci bugwama, kwa ne malana na cihano caba, nga̱ ina yaba hyan na zaro i yiwa zata waba, hal korwo pa bwa buba yiwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Nga̱ aba hyan igingaa, kwa aba ne huge laco dinyiya, kwa igingaa ne ala aba ne lagana nya̱ hal i yinsan na ihuga̱ ina aba mace bware. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Nga̱ aba ese ne yaba, kwa ne hyan bwa na amaci a buba Imaryamu, kwa ne kuzta kwa aba ne pana bo cilabe. Kwa aba ne pasingya icwana yaba kwa ne paniga daje u zinariya, na tulare u luban, na mur kwa ne pana bo. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Kwa na maringya cinge caba na ayina a mewa, zwam bucuma bu Hwinsu bu numi ga hacube na halabuwa ata maringya pa Hiridus.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusuf na Imaryamu a sume korwo Masar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Nga̱ aba ali, kwa bucuma bu Hwinsu ne kore pa Yusuf na halabuwa kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;Hiridus ai gimbaga bwa zwama a hone bo. Masenge, zangi bwa na amaci a buba swame kore Masar madale ahwayo, kwa ne hin na goo maringya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Kwa Yusuf na masinga, kwa ne zangi bwa na amaci a buba na gita, kwa ne kore cinge ci Masar, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />a madale ahwayo hal korwo hon una Hiridus aba kwaji. Uni u sinji nga̱ Hwinsu uba zwamage i sinji, &lt;&lt;Na Masar gya na oga Bwa abumui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">I hunago i sawoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Nga̱ Hiridus aba a daki aco cidaka̱ a ia̠gi bware mahasa, kwa bware ne hoge sungorow dinyiya. Kwa ne cumana a hunage ka̱mu saawo si cware sina si yiwa na suwa u Baitalami na hasala ha uba, sina si hwacuwa haya harya ko sina si wucuwo, a i haruni zwama ina aco cidaka̱ aba zwama bware hon na aba hyan igingaa. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Na hon buni aba sinji ina aba zwame na unu bucubago bu Hwinsu Irmiya:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />&lt;&lt;A hoge cidaro na Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">bicwarwa bi cidaro ci na sungoro u soo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Irahila ibe yiwa na cidaro zwam saawo siba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">i wonje ca ubungago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">zwam saawo siba sina saba honage.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uringewo korwo u Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Nga̱ Hiridus aba kwaji, kwa bucuma bu Hwinsu kwa ne kore pa Yusuf na ulabuwa na Masar kwa <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />na hin, &lt;&lt;Masinge, zangi bwa na amaci abuba, maringe kore cinge ci Isra'ila, zwama aco na gimbaga se hone bwa a kwadagu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Kwa Yusuf na masinga, ne zangi bwa na amaci a buba, kwa ne kore cinge ci Isra'ila. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ama nga̠ Yusuf aba hoge an bwa bu Hiridus Arkilayus a yinda cigwama ci buca̱ buba, a yiwa na cigwama na usala u Yahudiya, kwa bware ne hoge iwasa kurwo hwayi. Kwa aba ne numi bware hacube na halabuwa, kwa ne kore usala u Galili <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />kwa ne kore na madala na cinge cina caba yiwa ne oge Nazaret. Hinda a sinji ina aba zwame na uno acubago a Hwinsu: &lt;&lt;Ai ugana bware Bunazaret.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Wa'azi u Yohana u Baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Na mohon muni Yohana u Baptisma i kore na hila̱ a Yahudiya iba ne cibaga cikarigo ci Hwinsu, na usala u Yahudiya, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />aba ne zwamaga, &lt;&lt;Cureje eewo nuhi, zwama cigwama ci zaro ci Hwinsu ci yabtano! &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yohana abe asa bucubago bu Hwinsu Ishaya iba cikarigo ci buba hin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;&lt;Bucahya bu yiwa na sangana cu'ogo ni hila̱, buba ne zwamaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;Kimugaga Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu yina;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">kimgana je hayina ha buba bui lagana!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Cilapo cina ci Yohana aba mabwada cisa cihinji ci urakumi; bware bu mapala utaka̠ na bii a bware, mare ma bware masa hagyasa, na cisuin ci hila̱. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Kwa aco Urshalima a kore pa bware, na ka̱mu usala u Yahudiya na aco ka̱mu a cinge ci uwo u Yodan, aba ne kulage pa bware. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Aba ne zwamaga magwata̱ maba, bware ne ia̱gya ga baptisma na uwo u Yodan.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Nga̱ Yohana aba hyan Haparisiyawa na Hasadaukiyawa dinyiya ne kulage ihuga̱ ina bware buba yiwa na bware bu ia̱gi aco baptisma, kwa bware ni hin naba: &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi saawo sa hakuba Gamba bui zwama i swame sungorwa u Hwinsu una yiwa na korwo? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Kimgana je cihano acihi cina ci ciba i curya eewo. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Ita ia̱ cikibi na hasoo a ha̱hin i hyan, &lt;Ciza Ibrahim buca̱ abuci.&gt; Ne zwama, hatare hana, Hwinsu ui pwan i zangi hatare han hasa saawo si Ibrahim. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />A iri akyabuco na haganda̱ ha u'on, hinda u'on una ui iwo imata i burya̠ i gunji on a kwama on na suwa ula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 3:10">. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />&lt;&lt;Ne miya gya ne ia̱gi baptisma zwam a cibe an i curu eewo, Hinda buna bu yiwa ne korya kacuta̱ a kamui, buna zake na koce; ko hataka ha buba ne pwanuwa i kumgaga, bube bui ia̱gya baptisma na a̱huru a burya̠ na ula hinda. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Bu kumgage bula u gyarya na wa wooba zwam a gwabuge ha puwa na kahogo. hinda i tanaga kahogo kaburu na a'uri, aba cubi hapwo na ula una uzaa na ma'uisaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ia̱gi Yesu Baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Hun na Yesu aba sere Galili korwo uwo u Yodan, zwam Yohana a ia̱gi bware baptisma. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Yohana a ka̱ri gazgana bware kwa Yohana ne hin, &lt;&lt;Gya buna na gimbago goo ne ia̱gi baptisma,&gt;&gt; Yohana a hyan &lt;&lt;Ama goo bu kore ahwamui! &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Kwa Yesu ne cane, &lt;&lt;Kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;Sa harbuni; u ia̱ gama ga̱ci sinji ka̱mu ina zaa magwata̱ zwam a sinji ina Hwinsu uba ka̱ri.&gt;&gt; Kwa Yohana aba ne yajaa bware.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Nga̱ aba ia̱gi Yesu baptisma bware buba ne sere na miya kwa zaro na magunja a̱huru a Hwinsu aba ne kazingya ana a nyaga̱ ne ihurugu kwa aba ne kazinga ne icwa i Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Kwa aba ne hoge bicwarwa na zaro ne hin, &lt;&lt;Bwa abumui a buna bu gya na ka̠ri, na hoge laco u buba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">I gwaju i Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />A̱huru a Hwinsu a zangi Yesu korwo hila̱ ahwayo zwam setan u gwaji bware. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />nga̱ bware buba i mohon kope nasi na sigita kope nasi bui rewa mare, kwa Yesu ne huge imero. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Kwa Setan ne kure pa bware kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Si busa Bwa bu Hwinsu ringya hatare hana ha sanya̱ mare.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hin: &lt;Sa na mare buco buba bui sigi, kwa na ticimba cikarigo cina ca sirya̱ na uno u Hwinsu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Kwa setan na zangi Yesu ne kula bware ne i'ogo i nagu ciri Urshalima isum ina yaba ahunda̱. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />&lt;&lt;Si busa Bwa bu Hwinsu,&gt;&gt; an hin, &lt;&lt;Kwamana icwa nibui ni cinge. Zwam cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">&lt;&lt; &lt;Hwinsu ui cuma acuma a uba ahwabui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">ibu sak ni wa u waba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">zwam goo ta mabuzgya buna nibui na tare.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu kwa ne cane bware, &lt;&lt;Hwinsu hin: &lt;Ta ia̱gya bugwama bu doone Hwinsu alala.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Hinda, kwa buco bu eewo ni zangi bware ni i'ogo ini i zangari kwa ni ciba bware cigwama ci doone na ka̱mu izangacu yaba. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />&lt;&lt;Buco bu eewo a hin nibui pan ka̱mu, ini gya nibui cibe,&gt;&gt; kwa ni hin &lt;&lt;Si bui ni kuztan ni pan cilabe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yesu i zwama nya̱, macikai ahwamui, buco bu eewo! Zwam a rubuci: &lt;Bui kuztan Hwinsu Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu ububa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Kwa buco bu eewo ni curo bware, Kwa bucuma bu Hwinsu ni kurya na ia̱ bware ibwana.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i rwage numa u Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />nga̱ Yesu aba huge ana a gundiga Yohana na okaba ci'incu, kwa bware ni maringe ni Galili. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Yesu a curi Nazaret, kwa bware ni kore ni madale ni Kaparnahun, una u yiwa ni uwo usala u Zebulun ni Laptali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Zwam a sinji ina bucubago bu Hwinsu Ishaya iba zwamagi:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />&lt;&lt;Cinge ci Zebulun ni cinge ci Naptali una u laga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">yina korwo uwo, pa yina a Yodan ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Galili korwo pa aco ana ai dakuwo Hwinsu:<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Aco ana ayiwa ni ci'incu a hin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">malanga ma Hwinsu; ana madale ni cinge ci uhurhuru u'o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Daga hone Yesu i rwage cibaga cikarigo ci Hwinsu, &lt;&lt;Cureje eewo zwam cigwama ci Hwinsu ci yabtana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">I uganu silmajiri si jigu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu iba ni jabaga ni ugagi uwo u Galili, bware bu hyan aco barya ana sa a'osa, Saminu ana aba ne uge Bitrus ni buhun bu bware Andarawus. Aba ni taganu birigi ni kumbaga murege ni suwa uwo, zwama asa aco kumbagu imurege. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />&lt;&lt;Kurya, ni lagana,&gt;&gt; Yesu i hin,&lt;&lt;Ni sana i kulage aco ahwamui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Kwa aba curya utaru na iyi kumbagu muryage muwaba kwa ni lagan Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />nga̱ Yesu iba madanjigani, kwa aba ni hyan acagiya aco barya ana sa a'osa, Yakub Bwa bu Zabadi ni buhun bu bware Yohana. Aba ni suwa Jirgi u miya ni buca̱ buba Zabadi aba ni kimgana iyi kumbagu murege. Yesu kwa ni ugaga, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Kwa aba ni sire Jirgi u miya ni buca̱ buba kwa ni lagan Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="ms1">Yesu ihwingacume aco mahuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu i ese suwa Galili, ni cibaga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ni ukaba ahunda̱ waba ni cibaga cikarigo ci burya̠ ci cigwama ci Hwinsu, buba ni hwingacuma ti iri mamba mahuna ma aco. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Ibwana i Yesu ibe i ese tuhomba ni i'ogo Suriya, aba ni kulgage Yesu aco mahuna ti'iri mamba, aco mahuna ma sungorwo ma ikanga̱ , mahuna ma hila̱, mupyala mu eewo, ni mahuna ma ogi-ogi ni mahuna ma amaci Yesu bu hwingacuma ga. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Aco dinyiya ana a sire ni Galili, ni mu'ogo mukupe muna muyiwa ni usala Urshalima ni Yahudiya, ka̱mu ni aco ni yiwa ni ukacasu u Yodan a laga bware.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Numa Hwinsu zata ne e'ogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />nga̱ Yesu bu hin aco, kwa bware ni yinda zata wui i'ogo kwa ni madala. Silmajiri si bware kwa ni kore hwa bware, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Yesu bu hinan ni cibaga ga kwa ni hin:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />&lt;&lt;Unu u burya̠ usa wa aco a daki nagu koce a̱huru numa Hwinsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">zwam cigwama ci Hwinsu cisa caba<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Unu u burya̠ usa wa aco ni aba ia̱gi nagu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">i dulogo soo waba.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Unu burya̠ usa wa aco ni i zanguwo icwa yaba ihyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">zwam doone ui san waba.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Unu burya̠ usa wa aco ana i yiwa ni imerwa ni cu'oin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">zwam iyi burya̠ yaba, i sigocumaga.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Unu burya̠ usa wa aco ana aza yama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">zwam aba ma i huge yama yaba̱.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Unu burya̠ usa wa aco ana a zaa soo u burya̠,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">zwam i hyan Hwinsu.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Unu burya̠ usa wa aco ana ka̱ri dalo burya̠,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">i uganag saawo si Hwinsu.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Unu burya̠ usa wa aco ni aba wonje ga zwam iyi burya̠ yaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">cigwama ci zaro isa yaba.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />&lt;&lt;Unu burya̠ usa wa aco aba same laco, a wanjiga, agalogoga eewo ka̱mu ina aba yiwa zwam gya. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Ia̱ wa̱wo hugi laco zwam buzaa daje u labe ni zaro, harbuni aba wanje acubago Hwinsu kapi ga̱hi.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manje ni malanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />&lt;&lt;Izaa umpani nga̱ manje ma doone. Si manje ma hacigage laco maba, bece i kimgana? Mazawa umpani kwa di a kwama aco punjige.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />&lt;&lt;Isa nga̱ malanga ma doone e'ogo ina i yiwa zata izaa ciswin. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Aco a zaa kata̱ ula apicila a iri uwa imiya na amama. Kwa di a jukai zata ni amama na ukaba, zwam upa tuhumba malanga ni yaba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Harbuni, ciba aco malanga nibui, nga̱ aba i hyan ibwana ni hin i burya̠ apa Buca abuhi na zaro cilabe ci woba̱.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isinju inoma i Musa na acibago a Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Ita hyana nga̱ ni korya igazi ni cikarigo ci Hwinsu ko acubago Hwinsu; Na korya i gazi ama ni kore sinji gya. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Kamahinda ni zwama, kwa zaro ni doone u ali, ko cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci nuya ci kore, ko cina ci ibwabwa i nuya, cizaa ali kwa tibiya i sinji. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ka̱mu buna bu kacigage ina Hwinsu uba hin na a ia̱ noya u cikarigo ci Hwinsu ko hinda na cibagi aco ia̱ nga̱ uba ia̱ bui san kacutu ka eso cigwama ci Hwinsu, buna bu laga hinda bu cibage i lagano cikarigo ci burya̠ bui san buco bu labe ni cigwama zaro. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Ni zwama kwa cihano acihi ci burya̠ ci zake cina ci Haparisiyawa ni hawalami ha icibago Musa, kamahinda izaa ese cigwama ci zaro Hwinsu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I huno i buwama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />&lt;&lt;I huge a hin ni aco jigu, &lt;ta huna buwama, ka̱mu buna bu huni buwama ai kula ba pa mugwamgwam.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Ni zwama buna bu hacigage soo ni buhun bu buba i kula bwa pa mugwamgwam. Hinda, ka̱mu buna bu hin ni buhun buba, &lt;Utagi,&gt; ai kula ba pa mugwamgwam. Hinda ka̱mu buna bu cwane buhun bu buba , &lt;Ushashash!&gt; Hwinsu ui tana bo ni ula.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Zwam harbuni, buna bu yiwa ni pan Hwinsu daje ni ukaba wa ahunda̱ u Hwinsu bu mabutaryage azi ina gami ni buhun buba, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />Curya daje nibui ni ukaba wa ahunda̱ . Maringe i madale i makimga ni buhun abubui; kacumo goo maringe iyi daje nibui.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />&lt;&lt;I madale i makimga ni buna bu kule ni kotu. Makimgaji ni burya̠ na bware ga̱hi ni yina, zwam bube bu kula hwa Alkali, zwama Alkali aba cuta pa hapalgage, haba kwama ni ukaba u ci'incu. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Kamahinda ni zwama buzaa sire kwa bu cupe ka̱mu musare muna mwaba ana goo cupe.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cidana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />&lt;&lt;I huge a zwama, &lt;ita ia̱ga cidana.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ni zwama ka̱mu buna bu byane bu'a kwa ni tani soo buba rigani bu ia̱gi cidana ni uwa buba. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Si iyisa i wa u cuga yi sana goo i eewo, zacigya nya̱ goo kwama. Wui zake ni gama goo ise ni yaba Hwinsu ni iyisa uika̱ so waba i kwaman ikanga̱ nibui ka̱mu ni suwa ula. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Soo nibui u cuga wui sana goo i eewo, gunda uan goo kwama. U zake goo nagi wa u cuga susa goo bui ese ula ni ikanga̱ nibui ka̱mu.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I huno acage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hin, &lt;Buna bu hone cigya bui pana bu'a utakada ui huno acage.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ni zwama ka̱mu buna bu hune cigya, kwa di a kumbe bwa ni cidana, una ui san a uga bwa bu'a bu cidana, hinda ka̱mu buna bu aba hone cigya ci buba bu yiwa na ia̱ cidana.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kucuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />&lt;&lt;Hinda, i huge a zwama aco jigu, &lt;ta busa kucuna, kumgage kucuna kuna ku goo bu ma cune; Buco bu yaba Yesu.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ni zwama ta macuna: ni zaro zwama cisa cigwama ci Hwinsu; <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Ko nabiya ni cinge, zwam cisa mu punje mu Hwinsu; Ko ni Urshalima zwam isa i'ogo i labe i bugwama. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Ta macuna ni icwa nibui, zwam buzaa ipwana ihinji acine a sana asiri. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ga &lt;ini&gt; nibui usa &lt;Ini,&gt; hinda &lt;Aye,&gt; nibui usa &lt;Aye,&gt; uni hwace uni u sire pa buco bu eewo.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I cibago Yesu zwam u cupo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />&lt;&lt;I huge na jigu icibagu i Musa, &lt;Si bu zacige hisa ai zacige nibui, hinda sibu zacige iyela ai zacige iyela nibui.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ni zwama, ta wunda buco buna bu ia̱ga magwata̱. Sabu mari ni usugo u cuga, bicikaga ni usuga u gulo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Buna buba kule kara ni gimbo bucage cilapo, curgagya̱ bo ka̱mu ni ugojo nibui. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Si igwamgwam ibu san goo iyi cihano ci mil uika̱, kule na iba mil arya. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Pana buna bu une, ta yasa buna bu kaba̱ utasa.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka̱la̠ aco ana bu wonje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />&lt;&lt;I huge na cikarigo ci Musa, &lt;Ka̱la̱ buna bu madale ciyabu na goo wanje buna buba ka̱ruwo.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ni zwama, ka̱la̱ aco ana bu wanje ia̱gi aco na a yiwa nibui sungula ahunda̱, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Zwam isa saawo si Buca̱ abuhi buna bu yiwa ni zaro. Susa hwinsu u sirya̱ hwa aco eewo na aco nagu ciri sila a hine hwa aco burya̠ ni aco eewo. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Si i ka̱ri aco ni ai ka̱ri, umba daje gahi hin? Aco icago i ganju ai ia̱gu haruni? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Si bu sa̱ganu s'osa siboi sibasiba, begya goo bu ia̱gya ina i zake cage aco? Aco ana ai dakuwo Hwinsu ai ia̱ga haruniyo? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Zwam haruni zanje soo u burya̠, nga̱ Buca abuhin bu zaro busa bu burya̠.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Icibagu ipanu i daje pa aco na zaa ihya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />&lt;&lt;Yesu i hin, masikai ta ia̱ &lt;Iyi burya̠&gt; pa aco, zwam a hyan ana goo busa buca̱ bu burya̠. Si bu iyi, buzaa hyan daje pa Buca̱ abuhi buna bu yiwa ni zaro.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />&lt;&lt;Si bu pa, aco na zaa ihya ta zwamanya bucage, nga̱ malapukai maba iyi na ukaba ahunda̱ ni yina, zwam aco pa ga cilabe. Kamahinda ni zwama, arigano a co daje waba na doone. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Si i pa aco na zaa ihya daje, ita yada wa u gulo u daki ina wa cuga uba̱ pa, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Zwam ina goo bu pa isa na ciswin. Hinda Buca̱ abuhi, buna bu hyan ina aba iyi na ciswin, abu pa daje.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahunda̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Si bu gimbo ia̱ ahunda̱, ta ia̱ nga̱ malapukai haba ia̱gu, zwam aba ka̱ri sa yinsa ni ukaba ahunda̱ ni yina zwam aco hyanagaga. Kamahinda ni zwama, A rigano aco daje waba na doone. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Si bu ka̱ri ia̱ga ahunda̱ isa nokaba nibui, gundan i'iba goo ia̱ga ahunda̱ pa Buca̱ abuhi buna bu hyanagi. Buca abuhi, buna bu hyanagu ina aba ia̱ga ni ciswin, ui bu pan daje. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Si bu yiwa ni ia̱ ahunda̱, ta kubagana nga̱ aco ana ai dakuwo Hwinsu, zwam aba nga̱ Hwinsu ui hugiga zwam cikarigo ci woba dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Ita sana nga̱ ba, zwam Buca abuhi bu daki ina goo bu gimba kapi goo kaba̱.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Si bu gimba, ia̱, ahunda̱ ia̱ harbuna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">&lt;&lt; &lt;Buca̱ abuci buna bu yiwa ni zaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">ci pa ize nibui cilabe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Cigwama acibui ci kurya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">ina goo bu gimbago</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">a iyi na doone, nga̱ aba ia̱ga ni zaro.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Ci pan mare ma nawuya.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Ci yape magwata̱ amaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">nga̱ ga̱ci yape aco na ci ia̱gi magwata̱.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ta ci kula pa magwata̱, ama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">ci cagage pa buco bu eewo.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Si bu yape aco na bu ia̱gi magwata̱, Buca abuhi na zaro buba ma bui bu yape. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Si bui yapuwa aco magwata̱ ma ba, Buca abuhi ma bu zaa na bu yape magwata̱.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cu'unya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />&lt;&lt;Si bu yiwa ni cu'unya, ta onpana sinu nga̱ malapukai maba ia̱ga, zwam aco daki ana a yiwa ni cu'unya, Kamahinda ni zwama, arigano a co daje woba ni doone. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Si bu yiwa ni ci'unya masuktage manube ni icwa masiktagi sinu, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />Zwam aco ta daka ana bu yiwa na cu'unya, kwa di Buca abuhi, buna bu mahenagi; ni Buca̱ abuhi buna bu daki ina aba ia̱ga ni ciswin, bui bu pan daje.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ci'iru ci izana na zaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />&lt;&lt;Ta tanaga izana ni doone, ihuga̱ ina ha'urogo ni maruma mai hacigaga, ihuga̱ ina a'hya i pusi a iyi i'hya. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Ia̱ji ci'iru ci izana na zaro, ihuga̱ ina ha urogo ni maruma mazaa hacigaga, ihuga̱ ina a'hya azaa ipwana ipusi i iyi i'hya. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Ihuga̱ ina izana nibui ciba yiwa, ahwayo soo nibui uba yiwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />&lt;&lt;Haisa hasa nga̱ apicila a ikanga̱ . Si Haisa ahabui ha gyamace, ikanga̱ nibui ka̱mu ihyanaga ina ibu ciba ihuga̱ ina goo bu gimbo kore. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Si haisa a haba hai sa ha burya̠. Ikanga̱ nibui ka̱mu i san ci'incu. Ihyanagu ikanga̱ una u yiwa ni goo usa ci'incu, Ci'incu cini ci muse!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Azaa buna bui pa lagan aco yaba barya. Kwa di bu wanje buika bu ka̱ri buika̱, bui pan soo buba pa buika bu wanje bucage. Buzaa lagana Hwinsu ni musare.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ta madama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Hinda ni zwama, ta madama ni icwa nibui ini goo bui re ko iso; ko ikanga̱ nibui, ina goo bui mabwadan. Ikanga̱ nibui izake mare, hinda ikanga̱ nibui ya zakuwa hazunga? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Byana muwono mu zaro; mai kabaguwa ko ma gubi ko mu iyi ci'iru, ka̱mu ni haruni Buca abuhi ni zaro bube yiwa ni ryatumaga. I zakuwo ga ampani? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Gamba ciki nuhi bu pwa ni majidana ihun uika̱.<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />&lt;&lt;besa ga̱hi madami zwama hazunga byan nga̱ hunbe ha hila̱ haba si burya̠. i ia̱guwo ibwana ko amakimga. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Ni zwama ko Sulemanu ma i ma bwadganuwa hazunga hana ha gyamace nga̱ haba. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Susa harbuni Hwinsu uba su kimga humbe ha hila̱, hana nawuya ha yiwa na ubungwa ahwage a kwaman na ula, u zaa i zake ni bwadan ni hazunga, Gahi aco nagu tano soo? <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Ita madama, i hin, &lt;Igya gahi re?&gt; Ko &lt;Ina ga̱hi i so?&gt; &lt;Ko ina ga̱hi i ma bwadana?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Aco ana ai dakuwo Hwinsu ayiwa ni gimbo u ini ka̱mu, Buca̱ abuhi buna bu yiwa na zaro bu daki ana i ka̱ri ini ka̱mu. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Rwagwa gimbago Hwinsu ni jigu ni cigwama ci woba ni iyi burya̠ yuba, ini ka̱mu ibu jidana. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Zwam haruni ta madama na bungwa, ubungwa ui madama ni icwa waba. Tiyemba ihun izaa damuwa u ciba.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ita ia̱gya aco hukunci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />&lt;&lt;Ta ia̱ga aco hukunci, zwama goo ma ata bu ia̱gya. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Harbuna hinda Hwinsu uba̱ ia̱ga hukunci, nga̱ goo bu ia̱gi cagiya aco, ni ikwano ina goo mani na ibe yaba ebu a magya̱.<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />&lt;&lt;Esa gabui bisikai daba na hisa buhun abubui goo bu ma damuwa na ugunguri una u yiwa na yisa nebo? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Neya goo bu hin buhun abubui, yisana na bu zacigya daba na yiwa na hisa nibui, hinda tuhun lokaci goo na ugunguri na yisa nubui. <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />ga̱hi malapukai, rwaga zaciga ugunguri na hisa nibui, nga̱ goo bui hyan na burya̠ goo zancigi daba una u yiwa na yisa zaciga daba una u yiwa na hisa buhun abubui.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />&lt;&lt;Ta pana siwa mare mana ma zaa nagu ciri, ita panya silade i burya̠, si i ia̱ nabiya si maringe si punjige wui sananya̱ mahuna.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kabana, gimbaga, kwamtana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />&lt;&lt;Kabana abu pana gimbaga bui hyan. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />kwamtana i'eba ima gunja. Zwama buna bu kaba̱ ai pana bo, buna bu gimbagi bui hyan hinda buna bu kumta ai gunjigagya i'eba.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />&lt;&lt;Gamba ciki nuhi si bwa buba bu kaba̱ bo burodi bui pana bo tare? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Ko si bu kaba̱ bo murege bui pana bo ahwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ga̱hi, buna i daki eewo nga̱ ga̱hi i pana sawoo asihi i burya̠, bale Buca̱ abuhi buna bu yiwa na zaro bu pan i burya̠ pa buna bu kaba̱ bo. <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Na tibai, ia̱gi aco ina goo bu gimbagi abu ia̱gya, nga̱ ga̱hi gimbo ai ia̱gi nga̱ goo ma abu ia̱gya. Ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu na acubago Hwinsu uba hin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I'iba i nuya na ina i ha̱nri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Isaje na i'iba i noya. zwam i'iba ina i kore yaba ula i ha̱ri, aco muse dinyiya ana an yiwa ne lagan pa iba. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />I'iba isa i nuya a yina a iba ai kula buco pa a̱huru, aco na ise ata munsowa.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">U'on na imata yoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Byana na burya̠ zwam acubago cibya i korya ahwabui na utaka̱ u hatami, ama na soo waba usa siwa si hila̱. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Pa soo haba ga̱ci ci daki ga. A pwan i hyan saawo si inabi na suwa bikware? Ko hinda a hyan bikware na suwa u'on u muco? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Harbuni hinda u'on u burya̠ una u mace saawo si burya̠, u'on u eewo u mace saawo si eewo. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />U'on u burya̠ uzaa mace saawo si eewo, u'on u eewo uzaa mace saawo si burya̠. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Tuwa u'on una uta macewa saawo si burya̠ ai gunji unwa a tane na ula. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Zwama haruni, pa saawo saba gaci ci daki ga.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />&lt;&lt;Sa ka̱mu buna hin na gya, Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, bui ise na cigwama ci zaro, kwa buna bu ia̱ ina Buca̱ abumui buna bu yiwa na zaro buba hin. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Aco dinyiya, I hin na gya, Bugwama Hwinsu! ci iyi cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina ci yiwa na korwo na ize nibui? na ize nibui ga̱ci a̱ce mupyala mu eewo? hinda ci ia̱ al'ajibi na ize nibui? <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Hinda harbuni gya ne zwaman ga, gya ni ta dakiwo. Marabi je ni gya ga̱hi buna izi eewo.<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aco ema, an zaa mahasa na ana aza mahasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />&lt;&lt;Zwam harbuniyo ka̱mu buna bu hugage cikarigo acimui hinda bu ia̱ ibwana ina i ciba, bu nyaga na buco bu mahasa buna bu ia̱ ema yaba na tare. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Nga̱ silo aba a hene, ha jaba ha kule, mupyala ma masingai kwa ni supi yaba hinda yaba i hin uwa, zwama a ama nya̱ na tare. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Ka̱mu buna bu hoge cikarigo cina ci gya ni yiwa na ciba hinda bu ta iwo ampani na ciba, busa nga̱ buco bu cidana buna bu ia̱ ema na hega. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />A sila a hene, ha jaba wa kule, mupyala ma masingai kwa ni supi yaba, kwa iba na hene.<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hogi cikarigo kwa aco na hogi mamaki na cikarigo ci Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Zwama bware bu i cikarigo nga̱ buna buzi koce sa nga̱ walami a cibago u Musa.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu a Hwingacume Buco bu mahuna ma Cikuturu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Nga̱ bware buba bwa kanzigya ni i'ogo, aco dinyiya a urga bware. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Buco bu mahuna ma cikuturu bu korya kwa ni kuztan bware kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, si bu yaji, ni ringiya na burya̠.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu i dandi wa kwa eba nai danga idage. &lt;&lt;Ni yaji&gt;&gt; bware bu hin. &lt;&lt;Ma guzagi&gt;&gt; Ai sanuwo kwa Mahuna na curya bware. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Kwa Yesu ni hin na buba, &lt;&lt;Ta zwamana bucahya. Kula cibe icwa nibui pa bulabe bu yaba ahunda̱ goo pana sadaka una u Musa uba hin, nga̱ sheda pa aba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu i handgage bugyama bu isoja i Roma na mahuna ma amaci .</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Nga̱ Yesu iba ese Kaparnahun, isoja i labe kwa nai kurya pa bware ni gimbo u taimako. <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />&lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu&gt;&gt; bu hin, &lt;&lt;Bugyama abumui bu yiwa bu labuce ni yaba na mahuna ma amaci hinda bu yiwa na huge sungoro,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu i hin neba, &lt;&lt;Na kure i hwingacuma bo&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Kwa isoja i labe ni kwa nai hin, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, Nita pan bu kumgaga na yaba nimui numa, ga numa kawui bugyama abumui bui hwinga. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Gya ma na zaa musoja muna mu gya ni zake ga na koce a yiwa imiya na gya, si hin naba, &lt;Ala&gt; hinda aba ali, &lt;kurya&gt;, aba kurya. Si hin na bugyama a bumui ia̱ga buba ia̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Nga̱ Yesu Iba huge, i ia̱ mamaki kwa iba ni hin na aco ana a yiwa na lagan bware, &lt;&lt;Ni zwama kamahinda, na sa taba hyana̱ buco na Isra'ila buna buzi itano soo. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Na zwama aco dinyiya ai sirya̱ zata na ime, hinda ai re mare na Ibrahim, Ishaku Yakub na cigwama ci zaro. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Hinda aco kamace asa aco Hwinsu, hinda a wanje cigwama ai kwamanaga pa ci'incu ci siri pa aba ai darya na ire haila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Kwa Yesu na hin na isoja i labe, &lt;&lt;Ala! Ai bu ia̱gya nga̱ goo bu tano soo ai bu ia̱gya nga̱ goo bu gimbago bugyama bware bu hwingi na lokaci buni.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a Hwingacume aco Dinyiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Nga̱ Yesu iba ese na yaba Bitrus, bware bu hin kwasigo a Bitrus a labuce na cibaro a huguwa laco <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Bware bu kombe nya̱ wa kwa mahuna na curi nya̱, kwa eba na masinga kwa eba nai ia̱gya bware mare.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Nga̱ uyenbe ub i, a kulage bware aco mahuna ma mupyala mu eewo dinyiya, kwa bware na silacume mupyala mu eewo pa inumago numa kawui kwa na hwingacuma ka̱mu aco mahuna. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Bu yi ina zwama aba sinji ina aba zwaame pa unu bucubago bu Hwinsu Ishaya bu hin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">&lt;&lt;Bware bu zangaci ka̱mu mahuna nuci kwa nai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">zangaci ina si kuleya mahuna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aco na yiwa na lagana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Nga̱ Yesu iba hin aco dinyiya a ringa en, kwa bware ne pana izini a kaci uwo. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Kwa walami ui cibago Musa u kurya pa bware kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;walami, ne bu lagan tun humba goo bui kore.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Kwa Yesu ni hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Siwa si hila̱ si zaa hahambi muwono hinda muzi habonbo, Ama Bwa bu Buwama buzaa huga ina bui iri icwa i buba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Kwa bucage silmajiri si Yesu bu hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, ni maringe wumbanya̱ buca̱ a bumui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Kwa Yesu ni hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Na laganya, curya aco a kwajo a wumba aco na kwadagi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu u Butiga Mupyala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Kwa bware ni ese jirgi u miya silmajiri si bware kwa ne lagana bware. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Kwa mupyala mu koce ne masinge na wo, kwa ijwakwa miya ni masingagi ni isaga na suwa jirgi u miya. Yesu eba ne malabo. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Silmajiri si kore kwa ni zime bware, kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Buca bu yaba, Hwinsu kurya ci cagage ni u'o! Miya ma ka̱ri na ci re!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Kwa bware ni hin, &lt;&lt;Sa ga̱hi ni hugi wasa ga̱hi buna izi nagu tano soo?&gt;&gt; Kwa bware ne masinga kwa ne butana mupyala mu eewo, kwa muba ni uwatana.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Kwa aco ni huge mamaki kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Buco buna busa iri wamba? Hal ma mupyala na jwakwa miya i yiwa ni laga bo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu u Hwingacume aco barya a Mupyala mu eewo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Nga̱ bware buba kaci usala u Garasinawa, kwa aco barya a mahuna ma mupyala mu eewo kwa ne sirya̱ na hazin kwa ni bangi bware. Asa aco iwasa a zaa buna bu pwan ilagana a yina niya. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ai sanuwo kwa muba ni sana cu'ogo kwa ni hin &lt;&lt;Bwa bu Hwinsu, ko bu kure ni ci sungula kapi lokaci u i.?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Ciyabu naba azaa garke u silade si labe siba ni ihuba̱. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Mupyala mu eewo kwa ne makaba̱ Yesu, &lt;&lt;Si bu ci ance, sana ga̱ci ci ese ni suwa u garke u Silade.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu u hin na muba, &lt;&lt;Alaje!&gt;&gt; Kwa muba na sire na ese na suwa garke u Silade, kwa silade ka̱mu ne masingya kwa ni ese ni suwa uwo kwa ni kwaji na suwa u miyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Ahuban silade kwa ne ia̱mana munda, a ese ni i'ogo kwa ni cubaga ina hin, na aco mupyala mu eewo. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Kwa aco e'ogo ni sire ka̱mu ni sire zwama a kore pa Yesu. Nga̱ aba hyan bware, kwa aba ne makaba̱ bo, a hin bware bu curi cinge caba.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu i handgage buca̱ u mahuna ma amaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu i ese na suwa u jirgi u miya, kwa ni kaca ukacaso una uyiwa na i'ogo i bware. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Acagiya aco a kulage bware buco bu mahuna ma amaci, a labute bware na cibaro. Nga̱ Yesu eba hyan itano soo yaba, kwa bware na hin na buco bu mahuna ma amaci, &lt;&lt;lapta soo, magwata̱ amabui abu curigagu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Nga̱ aba hugi haruni, hawalami hai cibago i musa amazwama, &lt;&lt;Buco buna bu yiwa ne cwa Hwinsu!<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Nga̱ Yesu aba daki ina aba yiwa ne wugi na soo haba, kwa aba ni hin, &lt;&lt;besa ga̱hi i yiwa na hugi eewo na hasoo ahahi? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Be zake na sauki: Na hin &lt;Abu curigagu magwata̱ amabui,&gt; ko hinda a hin, &lt;masinge i cihano&gt;? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Zwama ga̱hi daki ana Bwa bu Buwama buza koce na cinge buba bui curigagya buco magwata̱.&gt; Kwa bware na hin na buco bu mahuna ma amaci, &lt;&lt;Masinge, zangi cibaro acibui ali giwu.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Kwa buba na masinga kwa na ala giwu. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Nga̱ aco aba hyan haruni, kwa iwasa na kumbe ga; Kwa aba na pan Hwinsu cilabe, una u pa aco koce.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a uga Matiyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu a ali na cihano kwa bware na hyan bucahya ize buba Matiyu bu madale ni cago ganju. Yesu a zwama bware, &lt;Ni laganya,&gt; kwa Matiyu na lagana bware.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">. <verse eid="MAT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu a madale ni re mare na yaba matiyu na yumbe, Aco icago i ganju na aco magwata̱ a kore na re mare na silmajiri si bware. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Nga̱ Haparisiyawa haba hyan bware na re mare, ha kaba̱ silmajiri si bware, &lt;Be sa walami nuhi ayiwa ni re mare na aco icago i ganju na aco &lt;magwata̱&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Nga̱ Yesu iba hugi, kwa na hin &lt;&lt;Buna bu zaa mahuna buzaa i gimbaga likita, kwa buna buzaa mahuna. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Kuleje i cibage ina numa ni iba yiwa na zwamaga: &lt;Ni gimbo yama ahwahi, sa sadaka.&gt; Ne korya ugana aco burya̠ ama aco magwata̱,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A kaba̱ Yesu zwama cu'unya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Silmajiri si Yohana si kore kwa na kaba̱ bware, &lt;Besa ga̱ci na Haparisiyawa ci ia̱ga cu'unya, ama silmajiri asibui si ia̱guwo?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Neya buna buzi amaci bu bungi na imero kwa di si azaa? Lokaci u yiwa na korwo una amaci aba i curyaga; Lokaci yiwa aba ia̱ ia̱ga cu'unya.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Azaa buna bui yitaga cilapo guse na kele ipun, si bu yitagi i nadaga ihuga̱ ina mahanje isa ihuga̱ ina ma hanje izake hanju i jigu. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Azaa buna bui halana maro ma pun na ugwala u unge sa hala na gwala umupusi, miya ma inabi ma jiga, hagwala hinda hal ma jigi, zwama miya ma inabi masi kwa a hala na ugwala, zwama haruni azaa nagi miya ko hinda ugwala.<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikangaza ina kwaji na bu'a bu mahuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Bware ni cikarigo, kwa buco bu labe bu ukaba̱ wa ahunda̱ ne kore pa Bware, kwa ne kuztan pa bware kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Bwa bumui bu cu'a bu kwaji bane,&gt;&gt; Ama bui pwana i san bo hargagya bane si bu Kurya bu tane bo wanuboi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu a masinge kwa ni lagani bware, na silmajiri si bware.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Kwa bu'a buna bwa sanu ni jigi mahya haya ikope na harya bu kore kwa ne danga bware na kacuta̱ ka cilapo. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Ima zwama ni soo weba &lt;&lt;Si ni dangi cilapo ci bware, ni rumugi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu a mabiciki kwa ni hin. &lt;&lt;Lapta soo bwa bu mui,&gt;&gt; Bware bu hin, &lt;&lt;Itano soo nubui ibu hwingacume.&gt;&gt; Kwa mahuna ma bu'a ni hwinga.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Nga̱ Yesu aba ese yaba i buco bu labe ukaba̱ wa yaba wa ahunda̱. Nga̱ iba hyan aco na wubano ni hulan ibada dinyiya, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Kwa bware ni hin, &lt;&lt;Macikije piyi. Ikangaza ikwajuwo i yiwa na malabo.&gt;&gt; Kwa aba ni saman bware. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Nga̱ bware ni silacuma aco nijapu, bware ni ese nokaba kwa ni kumbi wa ui ikangaza, kwa iba na masinga. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Labari uni u ese tuhunba usala uni sizwaga.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a hwingacume burubu na upoke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Nga̱ Yesu aba curi huguni, arubu barya a laga bware, kwa ni ugan bware ne koce, &lt;&lt;Bwa bu Dauda huga yama nuci!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Nga̱ Yesu aba ese yaba, kwa arubu ni kore pa bware, kwa bware ni kaba̱ naga, &lt;I tano soo gya pwan hwingacume?&gt;&gt; a cane bware,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">&lt;&lt;Harbuni, Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu,&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Kwa bware ni danga hisa haba kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;Ni itano soo nuhi ai hwingacume&gt;&gt;; <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Kwa hisa haba ne magunja. Yesu kwa ni zwamanaga, &lt;Ita yada bucahya bu daki.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Kwa aba ni ala ni zwamgana aco na usala ini bware buba ia̱gyaga.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Bware buba ni sire nijapu, kwa bucahya buna buzi mahuna ma mupyala mu eewo hinda bui panuwa cikarigo. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Nga̱ bware buba a̱ce mupyala mu eewo, buco buna bui panuwa cikarigo bu'i cikarigo, aco ni amatanaga a hugi mamaki kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Ese tabuwa i hyan iri ina ni Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Ama kwa Haparisiyawa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Ni koce bugwama bu siljanu buba yiwa ni silacuma ga mupyala mu eewo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aco ibwana ai musuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu i laga mu'ogo mu labe na mu nuya, ni cibaga na ukaba ahunda̱ mu waba, ni cibaga cikarigo ci burya̠ ci cigwama ni hwingacuma ti mani mahuna. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Nga̱ bware buba hyan aco, kwa bware ni hoge yama yaba, zwama aba hoge songoro hinda azaa buna bui bangan ga, nga̱ hatami hana hazaa buhubo. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Kwa Yesu ne hin na silmajiri si bware, &lt;&lt;Gubo u muse dinyiya ama aco ibwana a musuwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Zwam harbuni kabanije bugwama bu doone Hwinsu bu cumana aco ibwana a ia̱gya ga ibwana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu i cuma silmajiri siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu i uga silmajiri siba ikope na sirha̱ bu pa sa koce ui silacuma mupyala mu eewo na mahuna timamba.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Haziya ha acuma a Yesu ikope na sirha̱: jigu, Saminu (buna bu aba ogo Bitrus) ni buhun bu bware Andarawus Yakub bwa bu Zabadi, ni buhun bu bware Yohana, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filibus na Bartalomi, Toma na Matiyu bu cago bu ganju, Yakub bwa bu Halfa, na Taddiyus, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Saminu buco bu cinge ci Ka'anan na Yahuda Iskariyoti, ina i cibe Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Aco ikupe na burya̠ abe Yesu iba cuma kwa na hin naba: &lt;&lt;Ita esa ina isa i aco ana ai dakuwo Hwinsu ko i'ogo i Samariya. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Kulaje pa hatami ha Isra'ila hana ha inage. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Si ese ina i ga̱hi i cibaga bena: kurwa cigwama ci zaro u yabtano. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Aco ana ai hugo, laco i hadgage ga, i asinge aco na kwaji, ha kuturu i ma guzagi ga hana na mahuna, i silacuma mupyala mu eewo. Daje aba bu pa, daje goo bui pan. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Ita zangi zinariya, na musare, na cilapo na muhin na iyi mapala; <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Ita zanga ipamu na cihano cina, ko cilapo ciri, ko hataka ko agungu i zwama buna bu yiwa na ibwana u gyamace bu hin ia̱ i kamace,<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />&lt;&lt;Si ese i'ogo ko hila̱, kaba̱ buco bu burya̠ imadale na yaba buba kapi hun na ga̱hi i ala. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Ga̱hi na ese yaba, i saniga. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Si yaba na gimba dala a burya̠ , u yana na yaba ni, si zaa ba; salama nibui u maringiya a hwabui. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Si aco wanje na ca ko a kubule cikarigo, masosoryage bu ala na buna nuhi i sire yaba ko i'ogo ni. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Kamahinda gya ni zwama, ko Sodom ni Gomara wai zake i'ogo ni huna Hwinsu ui ia̱ hukunci&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Ni yiwa na cuma nga̱ hatami na suwa siwa si hila̱. Na zwaman zana mahasa nga̱ ahwa hinda i yana nga̱ mutantabara.<verse eid="MAT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />&lt;&lt;I masikai na aco, zwama ai kula pa mugwamgwam i pan bo bulala na ukaba ahunda̱ muwaba. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Zwama gya ai kula pa hagwamnoni na mugwamgwam zwama ga̱hi isa sheda cikarigo pa aco ana ai dakuwo Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Sa a kumbe, i ta madami na ina ga̱hi i zwame ko nga̱ ga̱hi i zwamaga. Hon niya ai pan ina gahi i zwame, <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Sa ga̱hi i kargyana, ama a̱huru a Buca abuhi abe ai ia̱ cikarigo. <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />&lt;&lt;Aco ni cuhun caba, ai hyan buna bui hone bu cage, buca hinda bui hune bwa, saawo si za hugaga numa hacaca, hal si sana a hunage hacaca ha siba. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Aco ka̱mu ai wanda zwam gya, ama buna bui yisan hal ihogu bui hyan a̱huru ana zaa ihogu. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />I hugi an si ga̱hi hyan ai dame, swamje pa i'ogo i maiwa. Kamahinda gya na zwama, kapin ga̱hi ma hogi i ringi mo'ogo mu Isra'ila Bwa bu Buwama bui kurya.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />&lt;&lt;Silmajiri ai zakuwa walami, ko hinda bugyama bu zakuwa buca bu yaba buba. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ina i yiwa silmajiri a yan nga̱ walami waab, hinda bugyama nga̱ buca bu yaba. Sa a uga buca bu yaba Ba'alzabul, be aba ai ugan aco yaba! <verse eid="MAT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Ita huga iwasa yaba. Azaa ina i yiwa na ciswin azaa hyan gya. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Ina gya ni zwama na ci'incu, na kargya gi na hwinsu, ina aba ai na kublani na hacube, a zwamagana na zata ui sumu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Ita huga iwasa aco na ai hune ikanga̱ ama a panuwa i hune a̱huru. ama, huge iwasa buna bui hune a̱huru na ikanga̱ hinda a tane na ula. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Ai ta sangwa Akukuturu arya na musare? A zaa uika una ui hene na cinge sa na idaku i Buca abuhi. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Cihinji ci icwa nebu cima rutage. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ta huga iwasa. Izake si Akukuturu.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />&lt;&lt;Buna bui hugo mu'inya i zwaman aco ana busa abumui, gya ma nazaa i huge mu'inya mu buba pa Buca abumui na zaro. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Buna bu hin gya na sa buba na haisa ha aco, Gya ma na hin an na daku bwa pa Buca abumui bu zaro.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />&lt;&lt;Ita hyana̱ nga̱ na kule dala a burya̠ , na doone. Ne koreya dala a burya̱, ama kasakari. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Na koreya zwam gya san</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">&lt;&lt; &lt;Buco buta yada na buco bu buba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">bwa bu cu'a buta yada na amaci a buba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">yawo ita yada na kwasigo ai ba<verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Buco buna bu wanje bu yiwa suwa aco yaba buika̱ na an goo.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />&lt;&lt;Buna bu zake ka̱ri buce bu buba ko amaci a buba bui jubuwa busa abumui yo; Buna bu zake ka̱ri bwa ko bwa bu cware bui jubuwa busa abumui; <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Ka̱mu buna bui zanguwo u'on masacu ma buba bu na laganya ba bui jubuwa ba sa abumui <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Ka̱mu buna bu ka̱ri cagi a̱huru a buba bui nagi uwa, buna bu nagi a̱huru a buba zwama gya bui hyan uwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />&lt;&lt;Buna bu ce ga̱hi buna ce gya, buna hinda bu ma ce gya buce buna buni cuma. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Buna bu ce bucubago bu Hwinsu zwama buba sa acuma a Hwinsu bu ce daje u bucubago bu Hwinsu, hinda buna bu ce buco bu nagu ciri bui ca daje u buco bu nagu ciri. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Buna bu pa i kopi saawo sina miya ma duri zwam siba sa silmajiri a simui, kamahinda buzaa i nagi daje buba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Yohana u Baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Nga̱ Yesu uba hogi cuman silmajiri su uba kupe na sirya, kwa burya̠ ni hinanan cibaga na i'ogo aba ogo Galili.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />nga̱ Yohana U yiwa na yaba ci'incu uba̱ huge ina Kristi abe yiwa na ia̱gagi kwa uba na cuma silmajiri si bware. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />A kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;Gabui busa buna bu yiwa ne kore, ko nabiya ci byane bucage?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Kwa Yesu na cane ga, &lt;&lt;maringe je i zwama Yohana ina ga̱hi hyan i huge. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Arubu a yiwa na hyanaga, agunu a yiwa na jabage hakuturu a yiwa na hwingaga, ana a hugaguwa a yiwa na hugaga ana kwadagi a masingya. Cicuma ci burya̠ cibe cisa aco na zaa ihya i huge cikarigo ci burya̠ . <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Unu burya̠ yiwa pa buna bu iyiwo shaka nimui iyajo ina buba buzaa na gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />nga̱ silmajiri si Yohana siba ali, kwa Yesu ni hin na aco gami na Yohana: &lt;&lt;iba nya̱ ga̱hi kori na hila̱ i hyan? I kore i hyan humbe hana ni upala muba hulagan&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />si sa harbuniyo, i gya ga̱hi sire i hene? Bu ma buna bu ma bwada hazunga ha burya̠ ? Aye, ana a ma bwada hazunga ha bware a yiwa na yaba bugwama. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Si harbuni igya ga̱hi kuri hyan, bucubago Hwinsu? kamahinda, na zwama, Harbuni zwama buna bu zake bucubago Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Buna bubiya cikarigo ci Hwinsu aba rubuci zwama buba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ni cumana bucuma bu sangi kuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">buna bu kimgana ihuga̱ kapi gya kore.<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Kamahinda ne zwama, a sitabuwa mace bucahya na doone buna bu zake Yohana u Baptisma cilabe ka̱mu na harbuni, buna busa buniya na cigwama ci Hwinsu bu zake burya̠ na moso. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />huna Yohana u Baptisma, hal baniya, cigwama ci Hwinsu na zaro u yiwa na sugala, aco na yiwa na zaga na koce. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Ka̱mu acubago Hwinsu na hawalami a iyi cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina ci yiwa na korwo u Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Si yaje i ce, bware busa Iliya na yiwa na korwo. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Buna buzaa hacube bu hugage.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />&lt;&lt;Ni begya gya ni ia̱ ina nyaga na zamani una? Nga̱ saawo si zamani na, ana a madale na kasuwa aba na ma ugana sicagiya aba na ma'ugana.<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Ci hulagi arewa̱ pa ga̱hi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">hinda ya iyiwo ci cihibo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">ci iyi hazuga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">ha u'o ye cidaro.<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Zwam Yohana u kore bui regwa mare ko i sogu i ciso, ama a hin, bu buzaa mupyala mu eewo&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Bwa bu Buwama bu kure bu regwa mare hinda bu swagu i ciso, kwa aba ni hin, &lt;&lt;Hyan buca buna, buna bu regwa hinda bu swagu dinyiya buzaa si'osa si bware aco icago i ganju na &lt;&lt;aco magwata̱&gt;&gt;&gt; ka̱mu na haruniyo, a hyanagagu mahasa ma Hwinsu na ibwana buba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu'ogo muna mu wanji curi eewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Kwa Yesu na hinan bu tagana mu ogo muna bware buba ia̱gi i al'ajibi zwam a wanje curi eewo. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Yama nuhi aco korasin! kaico aco Betsaida! Si iyi al'ajibi ana aba iyi na Taya, na Sidon, a ma sukutage mutwo na hakanga haba a cibe an a curu eewo! <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Kamahinda na zwama, huna Hwinsu ui ia̱ hukunci ai zake hugi yama aco Taya na Sidon pa ga̱hi. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Goo, hinda Kaparnahun! bu uguna a ka̱ri na bu zangaca hal kore zaro?. Ina aba ia̱gi ai bu kule doone aco na kwajo, a ia̱ ibwana al'ajibi pa ga̱hi, a iyi sa hona na Sodom, hona aba hukacumiga a zaa ikwadaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Kamahinda na zwama wui zake na yama huna i'ogo i Sodom na huna Hwinsu ui ia̱ hukunci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kurya je ahwamui zwama i hyin Ihupacu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Na Lokaci ni kwa Yesu na hin &lt;&lt;Nibui pan cilabe Buca Hwinsu u zaro na cinge, zwama bu swin ina aco ana zaa cidaka̱ na ha walami, kwa na cibage saawo su nuya. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Harbuni, Buca, zwama ina bui ia̱gi gama.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱mu tibe ana panu na wa numui na Buca abumui, ko na buna bu daki bwa kwa buca, ko na buna bu daki Buca kwa Bwa, kwa hinda buna bu Bwa buba yaje buba bui dakacuma̱.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Kwa Yesu na hin &lt;&lt;Kureje ka̱mu, ga̱hin buna i nibwa na cidama ci icwana i mure gya hinda na pana uhupacu. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Cutanaje sicwa asihi, ga̱hi i laga yina nimui, zwam gya na zaa soo duri, i hin i hupacu i a̱huru nuhi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Zwamu ugunguri nimui u zaa sungorwo, cicuma cimu ce muriwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Makaba̱ ma hon uhupacu u Hayahudawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Azaa huna u Yesu eba laga, usala u inta hun Asabar. Silmajiri seba nga̱ siba hogi imerwa kwa siba na hinana iwada imata burya̱ siba na re <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />nga̱ Haparisiyawa haba hyan, kwa haba na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Byana! Silmajiri asibui ayiwa na ia̱ga ina wa kamacuwa a iyi hun asabar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;I huguwa ina i Dauda uba ia̱ nga̱ buba huge imerwa? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Bu ese yaba Hwinsu, ni bware na a'usa a ibwana i bware ka̱mu na bware a re ina wa kamacuwa bware na a'usa a ibwana i bware aba re, kwa bulabe bu yaba ahunda̱. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Ko i karantuwa na cikarigo ci Hwinsu ana hun u asabar alabe a yaba ahunda̱ a hacigaga hun uni hinda ai hyanuwa magwata̱ maba? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Na zwama buna bu zake iginga bu yiwa pini <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Siya daki ina zwamani uba sa, &lt;Na gimbo yama, sa sadaka,&gt; yazaa pan hune aco na ai iwo ihya. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Bwa bu Buwama busa Hwinsu u asabar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Nga̱ buba madajigane, bu ese ukaba̱ ahunda̱ i labe yab, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />kwa bucahya buna buzaa mahuna ma wa uika. A ginbage nga̱ aba ai pan Yesu magwata̱, kwa na kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;U kamace a hwingacuma buco na mahuna hun asabar?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Si buzaa bitami bina bi matane na ugabugabu hun wa asabar, buzaa silacume hun niyo? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Aco ai zakuwa bitami! Zwama haruni u kamace a iyi i burya̠ hun asabar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Kwa Yesu na hin na naba, &lt;&lt;Numa̱ wa niboi&gt;&gt; kwa buba na numi wa u buba na maringe nga̱ uba yanse, nga̱ wa u mewa. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Kwa Haparisiyawa na kore i gimbaga nga̱ aba ai hone Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bugyama buna bu Hwinsu uba Tanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Nga̱ Yesu eba ya daki ina aba ginbo i huga. Aco dinyiya a laga bware, na bware bu hwingacuma aco mahuna Maba, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />kwa na zwamana ga ana ata zwamana bucahya ina bware busa. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Zwama a sinji ina acubago Hwinsu Ishaya iba hin;<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />&lt;&lt;Bugyama abumui buna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">buna gya na tanga, buna gya na ka̠ri, buna a̱huru numui yiwa ne hugi laco u buba dinyiya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Ni sinji buba na a̱huru numui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">bui yinsangya aco mu'ogo ka̱mu hukunci u kamahinda.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Bu zaa i gimbaga cuhurya̱ ko bu i cikarigo na koce pa aco.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Agungu an a ka̠ri na mabusa, bu zaa ibuse, an</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">upicila una u ka̠ri i kwaji, bu zaa hone unwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">bui san ina isa kamahinda i nasara,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Ni ize i bware mu'ogo ka̱mu ci tani soo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Bugwam bu Siljanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Kwa aba na kulage bware buco buna buzaa mahuna mataco, isa bebe u burubu na mupyala mu eewo, bu hwingacuma hal bu pwan cikarigo na haisa ha magonje. kwa Yesu a hwingacuma hal bware bu pa cikarigo ni hyanagu. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Aco ka̱mu a hoge mamaki kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Sa bwa bu Dauda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Nga̱ Haparisiyawa haba huge, ha hin, &lt;&lt;Na koce u Ba'alzabul bugwama bu eewo bware buba yiwa na a̱tanga siljanu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Nga̱ Yesu eba hyan soo waba kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;ka̱mu cigwama cina ci mahabsaga ciri cizaa i yisana, hinda yaba ina i marabi ciri hinda ci maka̠la̠nguwo izaa i yisana. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Si buco bu eewo bu ance buca bu eewo, bware na ia̱ huna na icwa i buba. Cigwama caba ci yisan niya? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Hinda si na silacumago mupyala mu eewo na koce u Ba'alzabul, to na koce gamba aco nahi aba silacumago? Abe ai sana silkali asihi. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ama si na silacumago mupyala mu eewo na koce Hwinsu, cigwama ci Hwinsu ci kurwa ahwahi.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />&lt;&lt;Ko hinda, azaa buna bu pwan ese yaba i buco bu koce bu zangi icwana kaza kaba̱ pare buco bu yaba? Kacumo aba hogi zangi icwana i yaba. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />&lt;&lt;Buna bu zaa na gya bui yajuwa na gya, hinda buna bu zaa na tanagana na gya bu yiwa na gatgaga. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Ni zwama, magwata̱ ka̱mu na cwane i Hwinsu ai bu yape ama si i cwane a̱huru a Hwinsu azaa i curya. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Ka̠mu buna bu galaga Bwa bu Buwama ai yape bwa, ama buna bu cwane a̱huru a burya̠ a zaa yape, ko baniya ko haya na yiwa na kurwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />&lt;&lt;Kimugana u'on imata i uba i gyamace, ko hinda sa u'on uta gyamata imata izaa gyamata, zwama a daki u'on pa saawo siba. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />ga̱hi saawo sa hakuba, niya ga̱hi isa aco i zwame cikarigo ci burya̠ ? Ina i yiwa na soo ibe unu uba su zwamage. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Buco bu burya̠ busa bu i burya̠ ina buba iri na soo u buba, hinda buco bu eewo busa bu i eewo zwama eewo ina i yiwa na soo u buba. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Hinda na zwama ka̱mu cikarigo cina ci sa ci burya̠ cina ci aco aba kargyagi na doone, Hwinsu ui ia̱ hukunci. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Na cikarigo acibui Hwinsu ui ia̱ hukunci, hinda na cikarigo acibui ai bu hune.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alama a Yunana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Kwa Haparisiyawa na hawalami cibago i Musa haba na hin na bware, &lt;&lt;walami, ci gimbo i hyan i mamaki ina goo bu ia̱ga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu i cane ga, &lt;&lt;Aco magwata̱ na aco ginbe-ginbe si'a a ginbago i mamaki Azaa cibe ga! kwa di i mamaki i acubago Hwinsu Yunana. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Nga̱ Yunana ibe i mohon mutaco na sigita sitaco na soo mukaba̱ mu irege i labe harbuni Bwa bu Buwama bui ia̱ mohon na sigita si taco suwa u cinge. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Huna Hwinsu ui ia̱ hukunci aco Nineba ai masinga ka̱mu na aco baniya, aba ai ciba aco ina aba iyi ia̱ iwo na burya̠ , zwama a curi eewo zwam icibago i Yona. Hinda buna bu zake Yunana bu yiwa pini. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Huna Hwinsu ui ia̱ hukunci, Isarauniya Sheba i zata i masinge i zwama aco baniya an ai iwo na burya̠ ; zwama i kanziga korwo cinge zwama i kubli cikarigo ci Sulemanu cina ci jidane mahasa, baniya buna bu zake Sulemanu bu yiwa pini.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />&lt;&lt;Si mupyala mu eewo mu sire pa buco, musa mu hina a̱nge na hila̱ na ginbago i huga i hupacu si mui hinwo. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Musa mu hin, &lt;Ni ma ringya ihuga̱ ina igya na sire! Muba na wuce, si mu bangi yaba zaa bucahya, kwa na kimugana i huga na burya̠ . <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Kwa bware ni maringya kwa na zanga mucage mupyala mu eewo utandarya̱ muna mu zake mu na magwata̱, kwa na madala. Ina i yana na ikanga̱ i buco i zake ina i jigu i Harbuniyo aco doone ui yan baniya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaci a Yesu na hunwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu eba na cikarigo na aco, amaci na hunwo bware kwa na yisana na ijapu, aba na ginbo ia̱ga cikarigo na bware. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Kwa bucahya na zwaman bware, &lt;&lt;Amaci nabu na ahun na bui a yiwa na japu, a ginbo cikarigo na goo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu i cane bu'a, &lt;&lt;Ga busa amaci na mui, hinda bamba asa ahun na mui?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Kwa Yesu na cibakana ga silmajiri si buba, na hin, &lt;&lt;Amaci na hun na mui bana. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Buna bu i cikarigo ci Buca̱ abumui buna bu yiwa na zaro abe sa ahun na mui na amaci na mui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Misali u buco bu cikaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Harbuni Yesu i sire na yaba kwa bware na madala na ugagi uwo, <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Kwa aco musi na matanaga dinyiya kwa bware na ese Jirgi u miya na bware na madala, kwa aco na yisangana na ugagi uwo. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Yesu i zwamage i dinyiya na misali bware bu hin, &lt;&lt;Buca bu kore cikaba na bero iyi cikaba. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Buba na ia̱ cikaba, kwa bero na hine na cinge kwa muwono na maryagan. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />I cagiya bero hine na gadaro, i huga na cinge ciba za dinyiya i bero puci ma'inta zwam cinge ca mirowa. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Nga̱ hwinsu uba wa danji, kwa uba na hukacuma cikaba hal ci hin ka̱mu, zwam hagande hazaa balee. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />I cagiya bero i hinage na kware, kwa kware ne zake koce u ibero. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />I cage bero i hinage na cinge ci burya̠, i puci kwa na ia̱ imata burya̠, dari, kupe cunuhin, kupe a taco. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Buna buzaa hacube bu huge&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Kwa Silmajiri si bware si kore kwa na kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;Be san goo si ia̱gi aco cikarigo na misali?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Kwa Yesu na canega, &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi a i yaje i daki asiri cigwama ci Hwinsu ama a panuga. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Ka̱mu buna buzaa dinyiya i jidana hal uzake muna jigu na musa ama buna bu zaa i hyan caga bo ci muna buba bu zaa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ina sa gya na ia̱gu cikarigo na misali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">&lt;&lt;Ko sa a hyan, a zaa ihyani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:13">ko sa a hugago a zaa i huge hal a daki ina goo bu kargyaga.<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Bucubago bu Hwinsu Ishaya bu hin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">: &lt;&lt; &lt;I hugaga ama i dakuwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">i hina mugingiwo ama i zaa daki ihya.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Zwama aco na soo waba u rigano wa darun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">hacube haba ha hugaguwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">wa a kubtana hisa haba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">zwama ata hyana̱ na hisa haba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ata hugaga na hacube haba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">zwama ata hin na siwa waba hal</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ambicike ihuga̱ , nimui gya hwingacumega.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Unu burya̠ mui lagana ana zaa hisa, zwama a hyan, hacube a ha̱hin na harbuni zwama ha hugaga. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Kamahinda na zwama, acubago Hwinsu na aco nagu ciri dinyiya a gimbago a hyan ina ga̱hi yiwa ne hyan, ama ai hyanuwo, hinda a huge ina ga̱hi yiwa ne huge, ama ai hugowa.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />&lt;&lt;Otanije i huge misali buco bu cikaba, <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Ka̱mu buna bu hoge cikarigo cina ci cigwama ci Hwinsu, hinda bu ganiwa bu nyaga buco bu eewo bu kore kwa na hugana ka̱mu ina aba kabe na soo waba ibero na aba kaba̱ na i yiwa na yina. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Ibero na hinage na ugandaro isa ka̱mu buna bu hoge kwa buba na ca na wa̱wo. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ama zwam hazaa ipicu u'on, wa sanuwo zwam songorwa uba wa masinge zwam cikarigo ci Hwinsu, kwa buco buni ne tare kacuta̱. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Ibero na hene pa kware isa i burya̠ buna bu huge cidama ci doone na maka̱la̱ ma izana, hal usa ko na ampani. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Bero na hine na cinge ci burya̠ , cisa bu ma buna bu huge cikarigo, bu gane, ca kwa na ia̱ imata burya̠ , ikupe kupe cunuhin, kupe taco ina aba kaba̱ ̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali humbe na Alkama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu a zwama ga acage misali kwa ni hin &lt;&lt;Cigwama ci Hwinsu una yiwa na zaro muyiwa nga̱ buco buna bu ia̱ cikaba na ubuki ibero burya̠. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Ama nga̱ ka̱mu aco na malabo kwa buco bu eewo na kore na gita kwa na bilaga ibero i humbe pa alkama, <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Bero i burya̠ na burya̠ hinda humbe hana buco bu eewo buba hitage kwa na puce.<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />&lt;&lt;Kwa bugyama buco bu ita, na kore pa buca bu yaba kwa na hin &lt;&lt;Sa Ibero i burya̠ goo bu kaba̱ ni inta nibui? ne humbe haba ha sirya̱?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Buco bu eewo bubiya bu iyi haruni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">&lt;&lt;Kwa bugyama na kaba̱ bware, bu gimbago ci kore mutangi humbe?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />&lt;&lt;Bware bu cane &lt;&lt; &lt;Aye,&gt; ita kula gyamui mutangu a humbe i mutangi Alkama <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Cureje a ia̱ unga̱ tare, kwa hon gubo ni zwamana aco gubo a gwabge humbe a tanaga, a palage, aba cubi ula, ama a tanaga alkama a hala na a'uri.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misali Ibero noya</para>
  <para style="r">(Mk 4.30–32; Lk 13.18–19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Burya̱ bu zwama ga acagiya misali &lt;&lt;Cigwama ci Hwinsu i yiwa nga̱ bero i mastad buna buco buba bu zangi bu kabi na inta. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Ibero ni isa nuya, ama si ipuce ya muse, i zake icage i u'on, i sana u'o i labe imata kwa uba na sa dage u'on hal muwono mu zaro mu kurya muhupaci na habonbo ha uba.<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Bware bu zwama acagiya misali, &lt;&lt;Cigwama ci zaro ci yiwa nga̱ yisti ana bu'a buba hici na kwano i labe hal ka̱mu nga̱ siji ana bu'a buba bu hici na kwano i labe hal ka̱mu nga̱ siji.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu kargyaga cikarigo cini na misali ka̱mu pa aco, burya̠ bu'a zwamagana ga cikarigo kwa na misali. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Zwama a sinji ina aba hin na uno acubago a Hwinsu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">&lt;&lt;Na gunja uno numui na misali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">na kargyaga ina ciswin tun na jigu na ai iyiwo u doone.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A iyi cikarigo ci humbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Yesu kwa na curi pa aco aba matanga̱ kwa na ese na yaba. Silmajiri si bware kwa na kore pa bware kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Ci zwama ina misali u humbe uba yiwa na zwamaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Bware kwa na cane ga, &lt;&lt;Buna bu kabe ibero burya̠ busa Bwa bu Buwama. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Usakata ube usa numa Hwinsu ibero burya̠ ibe esa saawo si cigwama. Humbe habiya ha sa saawo si buco bu eewo. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />buco bu eewo bubiya bu iyi cikaba ci humbe. Guba̱ abiya asa ihogu u doone, hinda aco gubo abe asa acuma a Hwinsu.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Nga̱ aba si tanaga humbe acuba ula, harbuni uba wisana na ihogu u doone. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Bwa bu Buwama bui cumani acuma Hwinsu, a tanago ka̱mu aco na san aco iyi magwata̱ na ina isa burya̠ a̱ta ga pa cigwama ci uba. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />I kwamana ga na yaba ula na si hukacumi ga ka̱mu, ahwayo i hugo cidaro na ciha̱ka̱ ci haila. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Harbuni aco nagu magwata̱ ai hinana na hin (malanga) i cine nga̱ muginga na cigwama ci Buca buba buna buzaa hacube, bu hugage.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misali izana ina maswin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Cigwama ci zaro ci yiwa nga̱ izana cina caba suin na usakata. Nga̱ buba juka buba gupa i swin, zwama wa̱wo kwa buba na kore sanga ka̱mu ina buba bu zaa, kwa na kore cupe usakata uni. <verse eid="MAT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />&lt;&lt;Hal buniya cigwama ci Hwinsu ci yiwa nga̱ buco buna bu ia̱gi curuma̱ na sangesange, buna bu gimbago hatare ha burya̠ , watau lu'ulu'u <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Nga̱ buba bu juka hatare ha burya̠ (lu'ulu'u) kwa buba na kore sanga ina buba buzaa ka̱mu kwa na kore isa usakata ka̱mu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />&lt;&lt;Hal baniya, cigwama ci zaro ci yiwa nga̱ Birigi bi ikumbago i murege ina aba kwama na uwo, kwa iba na kumbe murege ti iri mamba. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Nga̱ murege mu sinji iyi kumbago kwa buca buni na kuliya muna gagi uwo kwa na culana̱, kwa na tangan muna mu gama muna mu wagare, kwa na halana na itesu, jiga muna mu sa burya. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Harbuni uba wisana bu Hwinsu na ihogu u doone yona. Bucuma bu Hwinsu bu kore bu hadgage aco nagu ciri na aco eewo. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Aco magwata̱ i kwamana ga na yaba ula, ihuga̱ ina aba ai ia̱ cidaro na ciha̱ka̱ ci haila.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />&lt;&lt;Baniya i daki numa nimui? Yesu kaba̱ .</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Kwa aba na cane &lt;&lt;I&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Kwa bware na hin naba &lt;&lt;Zwam harbuni ka̱mu walami na yiwa na cibaga ina Hwinsu hin aba iyi, buna bu sana silmajiri si cigwama ci zaro. Usa nga̱ bubiya bu huzi yaba kwa na hugan ci'iru cina buba bu iri.<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bucuma bu Hwinsu buna bu zaa cilabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Nga̱ Yesu aba huge misali uni kwa bware na mawalan na curi ihuga̱ ini. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Yesu kwa na kore i uga ukaba ahunda̱. Kwa aba na huge mamaki kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Humba buco buna buba hyan mahasa mana? honba buco buna hin koce na? a kaba̱ . <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />&lt;&lt;Sa bwa bu kapinta abuna? Sa ize i amaci buba Imaryamu, sa buhun bu bware Yakub, Yusuf, Saminu ni Yahudiya? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Sa ka̠mu ahun a bware ayiwa ni ga̱ci? Humba buco buna hyan iruni koce?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Hinda ayiwa na gimbo a konbe bware na magwata̱.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Acubago a Hwinsu a zaa cilabe na i'ogo yaba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Hinda bware bui ia̱guwo ibwana i al'ajibi zwam nagu u itano soo.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">A gunji icwa i Yohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Azaa hon na u bugwama Hiridus a Antifas aba huge numa Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Kwa bware na hin na aco ibwana i bware, &lt;&lt;Yohana u Baptisma bini, Bware bu masingya pa aco na a kwadaga! Ube san buzaa koce ibwana ina buba yiwa na ia̱ga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Hiridus a kumbe Yohana kwa na gundan bware na ukaba u ci'incu zwama Hirudiya, bu'a bu buhun bu bware Filibus. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Zwama Yohana i zwamasi bware ana &lt;&lt;Ui kamacuwa bware bu ziye Hirudiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Hiridus a ka̱ri hune Yohana, ama bu huge iwasa ya aco, zwama a zagi bware nga̱ acubago Hwinsu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Nga̱ hun na uba wa rigya hun mamaco Hiridus bwa bu Hirudiya bu cu'a bu hibe cihebo na burya̠ Hiridus a hoge laco dinyiya, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />buba macune ana bui pana ka̱mu ina buba gimbo. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Amaci kwa na zwaman bwa, na hin, &lt;Ni panya icwa i Yohana u Baptisma na suwa ui ikwano&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Bugwama bu ma dame dinyiya, ama zwama kucuna ku buba i pa hanyagata ha labe, kwa buba na hin a i ina buba kaba̱ <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Kwa na sarike icwa i yohana ahwayo na ukaba u ci'incu . <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />A kule icwa i Yohana na suwa we ikwano kwa na pan bwa, kwa buba nai kulagya amaci abuba. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Silmajiri si Yohana si kurya kwa na zangi ikanga̱ Yohana u baptisma kwa na wunban. A kore kwa na zwaman Yesu<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu i ryacume aco dubu uta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Nga̱ Yesu eba hoge ina i, kwa bware na makumbulana ese jirgi u miya na ihuga̱ ina i zaa aco. Nga̠ aba huge aco dinyiya a laga bware na buna <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Nga̱ Yesu eba sire na jirgi kwa na hyan aco muse kwa bware na hoge yama yaba bu hwingacuma aco na a zaa mahuna.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Nga̱ uyinbe ub i, silmajiri si kurya pa bware kwa na hin na , &lt;&lt;I huga ina isa illa, hinda ci'incu ci rwago i iyi. zwaman aco a ese na mu'ogo a sanya̱ mare&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu i cane &lt;&lt;Ata ala. Pan jigu ina aba ai re.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />&lt;&lt;Ci zaa pini burodi uta na murege murya̠,&gt;&gt; a cane.<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Kwa bware na hin, kuliye api, bu cane.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Kwa bware na hin aco madale na humbe. Kwa na zangaci burodi uta na murege murya̱ kwa na byana zaro, kwa bware na goji Hwinsu kwa na pan silmajiri siba, hinda kwa na pan aco, <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Ka̱mu a re a sigi. Hinda silmajiri si tangage mukinda muna mu gane hal mutasu ikope na murya̱ muna mu gane. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Muso wa aco an a re a ka̱ri wuci aco dubu uta sa ka̱mu na si'a na saawo.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a jwabage zata u miya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Nga̱ aba huge kwa Yesu na hin na silmajiri si ese jirgi u miya a kaciye ukacaso, kapi bware bu sipe aco. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Nga̱ bware buba sallame ga, kwa bware na kore pa usala we i'ogo zwama bu iyi ahunda̱. Nga̱ uyinbe uba iyi, bware buba, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Hinda u jirgi u miya u mire pa Yesu iba yiwa na cinge, rigi i miya ebu ryaga jirgi zwama mupyala mu yanse dinyiya.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Misali u karpe ucunuhin na ubungwa kwa Yesu na kore pa silmajiri si bware , buba na jabaga zata u miya ma uwo. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Nga̱ silmajiri siba hyan bware na jabaga zata u miya ma uwo, kwa aba na huge iwasa, &lt;&lt;Upataluwa,&gt;&gt; kwa na hin kwa na san ci'ogo ci iwasa.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Kwa Yesu na halaga i hin naba &lt;&lt;Ia̠ga u cware! Gyamui. Ita huga iwasa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />&lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, si gabui,&gt;&gt; Bitrus a cane, &lt;&lt;I hin na gya jabaga zata u miyi&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />&lt;&lt;Kurya Yesu i hin,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">kwa Bitrus na sirya̱ na jirgi u miya, itada ne jabaga zata u miya kurwa pa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Nga̱ bware buba hyan irigi miya, kwa na huga iwasa, kwa buba na rwaga ihibi, kwa na sana ci'ogo, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, na ceci!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Yesu kwa na mahaguzana na cutan bware wa kwa na kumbe bware. &lt;&lt;goo buco bu nagu tano soo,&gt;&gt; na hin, &lt;&lt;be san goo bu zaa itano soo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Nga̱ aba ese jirgi u miya kwa mupyala na curya. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Aco ana a yiwa na suwa u jirgi u miya a kuztan bware aba na zwamaga, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda busa Bwa bu Hwinsu&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Nga̠ aba kaciye uwo, kwa aba na kazinga na usala u Janisarat. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Nga̱ aco aba a daka ana Yesu, kwa aba na cuman pa mu'ogo muna mu ringa cinge. Aco kwa na kulage bware aco mahuna. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Kwa aba na makaba̱ bo a hin bware bu curi aco mahuna a dangi kacuta̱ ka cilapo ci bware kurum, hinda aco na mahuna dangi bware kwa aba hwingacuma.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ciri na ina zaa ciri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Kwa Haparisiyawa na hawalami hana hai cibago Musa ha sire Urshalima ha kurya pa Yesu kwa haba na kaba̱, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />&lt;&lt;be san silmajiri asibui siba zaa na lagana cibago ci aco labe? Sima guzgago siwa kapi re mare!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Be sa gahi izaa na lagana icibago ci Hwinsu zwama al'ada nuhi? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Zwama Hwinsu u hin, pan amaci nibui na buca a bubui cilabe hinda &lt;Bina bu cwane buco na amaci abuba a hune bo.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Hinda ga̱hi i hin, si buco bu zwama buca na amaci abuba an &lt;ka̱mu i tano i wa ina i buco buba hin ahwamui izaa daje pa Hwinsu,&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />bu zaa i pan &lt;A mace nuhi cilabe&gt; ciba. Kwa ga̱hi na hacigage cibago ci Hwinsu zwama al'ada nuhi. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Ga̱hi malapukai! Ishaya i magalaganuwo nga̱ eba iyi cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina ci yiwa na korwo an ga̱hi:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />&lt;&lt;Aco na an pan cilabe na uno waba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">hinda ha soo waba ha mire na gya.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />A yiwa na kuztagan na cibya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">i cibago yaba isa cikarigo ca aco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Kwa Yesu ni oga aco ana a matanaga dinyiya kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;kublaje i hoge. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ina i ese na uno u buco sa ibe i &lt;&lt;hacigage bwa&gt;&gt; kwa ina ya sirya na uno, ina i hacigage bo bi ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Kwa Silmajiri si bware si kurya kwa na kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Bu daki ana Haparisiyawa ha dabe suwa nga̱ haba hoge cikarigo cini?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Kwa Yesu na cane, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mu cikaba cina cisa Buca abumui bu zaro bube bu bire ai muci ca. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Curya ga, Arubu abe yiwa na cibaga ga. Burubu si bu yiwa na kaji burubu, ai ma tana na ulanbu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Kwa Bitrus ne hin, &lt;&lt;Ci zwama ma'an ma misali uni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />&lt;&lt;Hal baniya isa hataguma?&gt;&gt; Yesu i kaba̱ ga. <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />&lt;&lt;I hyanuwa ina i ese uno i ali na suwa u mukaba̱ hinda i sire na ikanga̱? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Hinda ina ya sirha̱ pa uno i sire na soo, hinda i &lt;Hacigage&gt; buco. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Na soo, iwo sa hugi, ihono, ginbe ginbe, cidana, ihya, cibya, na ihacigagu ize.<verse eid="MAT 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ina i &lt;Hacigage buco bini;&gt; hinda ire i mare na siwa sina aba ai ma sigtaguwo i hacigago buco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">I yajo i bu'a bu Ka'ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Nga̱ bware buba curi payi, Yesu i kore usala u Taya na sidon, <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />kwa bu'a bu Ka'ana na kurya pa bware, na san cu'ogo buba na darya, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu Doone, bwa bu Dauda, huga yama nimui! Bwa abumui bu cu'a bu yiwa na mahuna ma mupyala mu eewo dinyiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Yesu i canewa bo. Kwa silmajiri si bware na kaba̱ na bware, &lt;&lt;A̱ta bo, zwam bu yiwa na cidama na cidaro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu cane, &lt;&lt;A̱n cuma pa hatami aco Isra'ila an inage.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Kwa bu'a buni na kurya na kuztan Yesu, &lt;&lt;bugwam bu doone Hwinsu, hoge yama na mui!&gt;&gt; Bu hin.<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Ui gyamacuwa a zangi mare ma saawo a pan siwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />&lt;&lt;Harbuni, bugwam bu doone Hwinsu&gt;&gt; bu hin, &lt;&lt;hinda siwa ma si ryaga mukinda muna mu hinage na tabur u buca bu yaba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Kwa Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Bu'a, buzaa itano soo dinyiya! Ina goo bu ginbage a ibu pan.&gt;&gt; Kwa mahuna ma bwa bu buba na curya bo a pani.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu i sigi aco dubu unasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Nga̱ Yesu eba curi Pani kwa eba na kure na uwo u Galili. Kwa ni yindan i'ogo na madala. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Aco na matanaga dinyiya a kurya pa bware, a kulage bware gunu, na rubo, aco na zaa buna, habebe na aco mahuna dinyiya, kwa na labuta ga pa buna i Yesu, hinda buba hwingacuma ga na mahuna. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Aco a huge iwasa nga̱ aba hin habebe na kargyaga, bugunu na jabaga, arubu a hyanagi kwa aba na pan Hwinsu u Isra'ila cilabe ci uba</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:31">. <verse eid="MAT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu i oga silmajiri si bware kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Na hoge yama ya aco na; a ia̱ mohon mutaco i re yiwa ihya. Na karuwo a ali na imerwa, ai mata na yina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Kwa silmajiri si Yesu na cane, &lt;&lt;Hunba ga̱ci ci hyangiyo aco mare na matanaga na hila̱ nga̱ na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />&lt;&lt;I zaa haburodi ha bamba?&gt;&gt; Yesu kaba̱ .</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">&lt;&lt;Utandara̱,&gt;&gt; a cane. &lt;&lt;Na murege cimu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Kwa Yesu na zwama aco a madale na cinge. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Kwa na zangi, burodi utandara̱ uni na murege, kwa na pana silmajiri si pan aco. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />A re ka̱mu waab tigaba bu sigi. Silmajiri si tangage mukinda muna mu wuci mutasu utandarya̱ muna mu gane. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Munsowa aco na re asa dubu u nasi, ai rutagowa si'a na saawo. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Nga̱ Yesu eba curi aco ali, kwa bware na ese jirgi u miya kurwa usala u Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Gimbo alama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Haparisiyawa na Hasadaukiyawa ha kore pa Yesu na ginbo igwaji bware a kaba̱ bware bu cibe alama a zaro.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Kwa Yesu na cane, &lt;&lt;uyinbe su kore, si hin, &lt;ubungwa u ka̱ri gyamata, zwam zaro u sen, <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na ubungwa hinda, &lt;&lt;Nawuya ai ia̱ mupyala, zwama ulala u seri hinda sila̱ a yiri, ga̱hi i daki hinda ga̱hi i zwamage si hin zaro nga̱ ub nyaga, ama ga̱hi i dakuwo pan alama a hon una u ga̱ci ci yiwa na uba. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Aco zamani aco cidana na aco magwata̱ ayiwa na gimbo alama, hinda azaa na ciba ko uika kwa di una u Yunana.&gt;&gt; Kwa Yesu na curya ga na ala.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisti u Haparisiyawa na Hasadaukiyawa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Nga̱ aba kaciye wo silmajiri si mainga na zangi burodi. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />&lt;&lt;Masikije Yesu i hin naba. &lt;&lt;Masikije na yisti u Haparisiyawa na una hasadaukiyawa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Ha i cikarigo na ha soo haba kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Zwama ga̱ci ci kurya na burodi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Nga̱ Yesu eba huge ina aba zwamago, kwa na kaba̱ na, &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi aco nagu tano soo, be san ga̱hi i yiwa na makargyana na sicwa sihin zwama nagu u burodi? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Hal kaba̱ niya i ganiwa? I ma butaryagya zwama u burodi uta na aco dubu uta, hinda mutasu mu bamba muna mu gane muna mu ga̱hi i tanaga? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Hinda ha burodi utandara̱ una u ryacume aco dubu unasi, hal mutasu dinyiya muna mu gane ga̱hi tanaga? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />be san ga̱hi idaku ana ni yiwa na cikarigo ci burodi? Masikije na zwama u yisti u? Haparisiyawa na Hasadaukiyawa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Kwa aba na daki an bware buzaa na ia̱gyaga cikarigo ci burodi na yisti, zwama icibago ha walami Haparisiyawa na Hasadaukiyawa.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bitrus a Yaje Yesu Abe Asa Masihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Nga̱ Yesu eba kore usala u Kaisariya Filibi, kwa bware na kaba̱ na silmajiri si bware, &lt;&lt;Be aco aba yiwa na oge Bwa bu Buwama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Kwa silmajiri na cane, &lt;&lt;Acagiya aco hin Yohana u Baptisma, aco mewa Iliya, acagiya hinda Irmiya, cagiya hinda bucubago bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />&lt;&lt;To ga̱hi pa ?&gt;&gt; Yesu a kaba̱ ga. &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi i hin gya nasa gamba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Saminu Bitrus a cane &lt;&lt;Goo busa kristi, Bwa bu Hwinsu buna bu zaa ihogu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu cane, &lt;&lt;unu burya̠ i bu lagana, Saminu bwa bu Yona, na daki sa buwama bube bu zwama, ama Buca a bumui buna bu yiwa na zaro. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Na bu zwama gabui bu busa, Bitrus, na utare buna u gya nai ma coci numui hinda doone aco na kwadagu uzaa izana koce pa goo, <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Na bu pan mabudi ma cigwama ci zaro, ina ga̱hi pare na doone ima pare na zaro, ina hinda ga̱hi pasingi na doone ai pasingi na zaro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Kwa bware zwaman silmajiri si bware sita zwamana buca hya an bube busa kristi.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu i daki an i kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Tun huniya Yesu a hina zwamgan silmajiri saba nga̱ aba, &lt;&lt;ne kore urshalima na sungorwo una iba i hoge na wa aco labe, na bulabe bulabe, na hawalami ha cikarigo ci Musa. Nga̱ aba ai hone bware na hon tacula bu masinga.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Kwa Bitrus na oga bware kwa na hinana i butana bware. &lt;&lt;Sa haruniyo, Bugwam bu doone Hwinsu bu hin. Ini izaa ia̱ga nago!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Kwa Yesu na byana Bitrus kwa na hin na bware, &lt;&lt;macikai pa gya na yiwa, goo buco bu eewo, goo buna yiwa na sana aco i magwata̱, bu zaa na soo nubui Hwinsu, ama i ya aco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Kwa Yesu na hin na silmajiri si bware, buna bu ginbo na lagana, bui wonje icwa i buba bu zangi u'on masacu buna laganya. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Buna bu gimbo ceci a̱huru a buba bui nagi an, buna hinda bu nagi a̱huru a buba zwama gya bui hyan an. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />be san i burya̠ si buco hin doone ka̱mu, buba nagi icwa buba? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Bwa bu Buwama bu ka̱ri i kurya na cilabe ci Buca bu buba na acuma a Hwinsu, bui pan tigamba lada buba nga̱ uba kamace bu hin. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Kamahinda na zwama a zaa aco ana a yiwa pini na gya a zaa i kwaji kwa hyan Bwa bu Buwama na kanzigya na cigwama ci zaro.<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ima sake ikanga̱ iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Nga̱ mohon cunuhin muba ali Yesu zagi Bitrus, Yakub na Yohana buhun bu Yakub, kwa na zagi ga na zata i'ogo hya i zangari na sicwa saba. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />A payi paba, bware&gt; mu ma sake ikanga̱ . Haisa ha bware ha nyaga na hwinsu, Hazunga ha bware kwa na sana ha cine nga̱ ula. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Aba apayi kwa aba na hin Musa na Iliya aba na ia̱ cikarigo na Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Kwa Bitrus na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, u gyamace nga̱ ga̱ci ci yiwa pani, si bu yaje, na ia̱ga hazaka̱ ha taco nabu uiko, Musa uiko hinda Iliya uiko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Bware buba na cikarigo, kwa ulala u cine na kubtanga, kwa aba nga̱ cikarigo na suwa ulala. &lt;&lt;Hin Bwa abumui abuna buna bu gya na ka̠ri, buna bu gya na yiwa na hoge laco buba. kublya bware!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Nga̱ silmajiri sinji, kwa tigamba na kuztan haisa haba na sinji , na iwasa <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Kwa Yesu na kore na dangaga ga. &lt;&lt;Masinge je&gt;&gt; bu hin. &lt;&lt;Ita huga iwasa&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Nga̱ aba byane zata, ai hyanuwa bucahya kwa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Aba na kanzigya zata ui i'ogo, Yesu i zwama ga, bucahya ina ga̱hi i hin, kwa Bwa bu Buwama bu ma asinge pa aco a kwajo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Kwa silmajiri na kaba̱ na Yesu, &lt;&lt;be san hawalami ha Musa haba hin ana Iliya ibe i zwamaga kurwa&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Iliya i kurya hinda kimgana tibai na tibai. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Hinda na zwama, Iliya i rigano ia̱ kurwa hinda ai ganuwa bware hinda a ia̱gi bware ina aba ka̱ri harbuni Bwa bu Buwama aba ai sunguluwa bwa,&gt;&gt; Kwa silmajiri siba si daki ani bu yiwa cikarigo ci Yohana una u Baptisma.<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu u handgage bwa na mahuna ma mupyala mu eewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Kwa silmajiri siba si daki ani bu yiwa cikarigo ci Yohana una u Baptisma.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu u handgage bwa na mahuna ma mupyala mu eewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Nga̱ aba a kurya pa aco aba matanga, kwa bucahya na kore pa Yesu na kuztan <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />&lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, huga yama u bwa a bumui,&gt;&gt; bu hin. &lt;&lt;Buzaa mahuna ma ogi-ogi hinda bu yiwa na hugi songoro. Busa bu matane na ula ko miya. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Na kuluwa bu pa silmajiri a sibui hinda sima yagage na silacuma mupyala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />&lt;&lt;Aco nagu iyajo na magwata̱, ni i burya̠ &gt;&gt; Yesu cane, &lt;Na pwana na mu'iba na ga̱hi? Na pwana i yisana na ga̱hi? Na kulagije bwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu kwa na butana mupyala mu eewo, kwa muba ni sire, bwa bu huge laco.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Silmajiri si Yesu kwa na kore pa bware buba kwa na kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Be sa ga̱ci ci mayagage na a̱ce mupyala muwo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Kwa Yesu na cane, &lt;&lt;Zwama itano soo nuhi i musuwa. Kamahinda na zwama, susa itano soo nibui i mastad nga̱ bero i bi tamba, bui zwama e'ogo na, &lt;Majwabugi daga piyin kore a paya&gt; i ma jobuge. A zaa ina i ga̱hi i zaa pwan ia̱ga. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />irun a zaa sire kwa di ni ahunda̱ ni ci'unya.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Nga̱ aba a kurya Galili ka̱mu waba, Yesu bu hin na aba, &lt;&lt;Bwa bu Buwama ai pan bwa na̱ wa wa'aco. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Ai hune bware, hun tacula bui masingya&gt;&gt; silmajiri si ma dame dinyiya.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ganju ui yaba ahunda̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Nga̱ Yesu na silmajiri saba siba kore Kaparnahun, aco icago i ganju kurya pa Bitrus a kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Sa hawalami nuhi a yiwa ni paniga ganju na muginga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Bitrus ni cane Harbuni bu kupago,&gt;&gt; Bware bu hin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Nga̱ Bitrus aba ese na yaba, Yesu abe a rwagi ia̱gya bware cikarigo kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Niya Saminu goo bu hoge na mukaba̱ muni?&gt;&gt; Bware bu kaba̱ . mugwamgwam mu doone mu cago ganju pa bamba-pa saawo saba ko pa aco mewa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />&lt;&lt;Pa aco mewa,&gt;&gt; Bitrus a cane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">&lt;&lt;saawo siba si za cupaga,&gt;&gt; Yesu i cane bware. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />&lt;&lt;Zwama a ta ci kumba na magwata̱, kula na uwo tane adako nibui na miya. murege ina goo bu rwage i kumbe; gunja uno we ba bui hin musare. Zango cupe gajo nibui na gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Buna bu zake moso na zaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Na hun ni kwa silmajiri si Yesu na kurya pa bware na kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Ga busa buco bu labe na cigwama ci Hwinsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Kwa bware na uga bwa bu nuya kwa na san bu yinsa no usa waba. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Kwa na hin: &lt;&lt;Na zwama kamahinda, kwa imaringe nga̱ saawo si nuya, iza ese cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Zwam haruni, buna bui maringiya nga̱ bwa buna bu nuya bube busa bulabe na cigwama ci Hwinsu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 18:4">. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />&lt;&lt;Hinda buna ce bwa bu nuya buna ni ize nimui buni ce. <verse eid="MAT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Hinda buna bu san saawo si noya sina tano soo pa gya sa i magwata̱, u zake a zangi a pala buco hinwo na bicwarwa a kwama bo na uwo una u zwamci.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ni yiwa na hoge yama i doone u niya una ui san aco yi magwata̱! Haruni ui kore, ni yiwa na hoge yam buna eba ya kurya zwama buba! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Siwa ko buna we sango i magwata̱, gunda on kwama. Uzake goo ese yaba zaro nagu u wa na buna u zake ese yaba zaro na siwa na buna ka̱mu ama a bu kwama na ula ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Si yisa nebo i sana goo i magwata̱, zaciga ia̱ kwama. Uzake goo ese yaba i zaro ana zaa ihogu na iyisa uika̱ susa goo bui ese yaba ula una uzaa i kwaji na haisa harya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misali u Bitamiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />&lt;&lt;itayagaga saawo sina si nuya. Na zwama acuma a Hwinsu waba a hyanagi sinu Buca abumui buna bu yiwa na zaro.<verse eid="MAT 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Bwa bu Buca̱ bu kurya bu cagi ina inage<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />&lt;&lt;Be ga̱hi hin? Si buco buzaa hatami dari uinka, kwa buika̱ na inaga, bu zaa kurya kope tanasi na utanasi na utanasi bu kore ginbo u bina bi inage? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Hinda sibo juka bo, kamahinda na zwama, bui zake ihoge laco bina buba hin na kupe tanasi una ui inaguwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Buca abuhi bu zaro bu zaa ihoge laco u sinuya si inage. Buhun buna buba ia̱gi magwata̱<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buhun buna buba ia̱gi magwata̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />&lt;&lt;Si buhun a buba bu ia̱gi magwata̱, kula zwama bwa magwata̱ ma buba, ga̱hi aco barya. Si buhun a bubui bu kublage, bu ringuwa buhun a buba. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Hinda si bu wanje hoge, zanga aco barya i kore na goo, zwama goo bui hyan aco burya̠ ko bataco ana ai yana kacuta̱ a kabui hun cikarigo zwama asa sheda. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Si bu wanje i hoge cikarigo ciba, zwaman aco coci; zanga bwa nga̱ buna bui dakuwo Hwinsu ko aco icago i ganju.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />&lt;&lt;Kamahinda gya na zwama, ina ga̱hi a pare na cinge ai paregya na zaro, hinda ina ga̱hi pasinge ai pasigigya na zaro.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />&lt;&lt;Hinda, kamahinda na zwama si aco burya̠ na cinge a mapare a kaba̱ Hwinsu ihya, Buca̱ a bumui bu zaro bui panga ina aba kaba̱ bo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Ihuga ina aco barya ko bataco aba matanaga na ize nimui, Niyiwa tare naba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misali u bugyama buna buzaa iyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Bitrus a kurya pa Yesu kwa na kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, magwata̱ ma bamba buhun abumui buba bui na ia̱gya gya yape bo? Hal kurwa utandarya̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Na zwama, sa utandara̱. ama ikupe so utandara̱<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />&lt;&lt;Zwam Harbuni, cigwama ci Hwinsu ci nyaga na bugwama buna bu ka̱ri agyama buba a rutage ina buba lagano ga. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Nga̱ buba rwage i rutago, buna bu buba lagano utase u talent dubu ikope aba a kulage bo. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Nga̱ buba bui pwanuwa icope, kwa buca bu yaba buba ni hin a kumbe bo na bu'a bu buba na saawo na ina buba za ka̱mu a sange zwam a cupe utase.<verse eid="MAT 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Kwa bugyama ne kuztan buca bu yaba. &lt;Hog yama numui,&gt; &lt; Na bu cupa tibai ka̱mu!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Buca bu yaba kwa na hoge yama bugyama buba, kwa buba ne yape bugyama utasa.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Hinda nga̱ bugyama buba sere na ijapu, kwa buba na hyan bugyama bu mewa buna buba i yiwa cigyama tare na buba hinda bu yiwa ne lagana utase u musare kwa ni kombe bo bicwarwa &lt;&lt;Na cope ina gya na bu lagano!&gt; bu hin.<verse eid="MAT 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />&lt;&lt;Buna aba yiwa ne cigyama kuzta bo na, &lt;Labta soo nuhi na gya!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Ama bu wonje; Ina buba i, bu ali kwa na san a gunda bwa na ukaba u ci'incu, kwa bu cupe ina aba lagano bo utase. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Nga̱ acagiya agyama aba hyan ina i, aba huge mamaki dinyiya kwa aba na kore na zwama buca bu yaba ina ia̱gi ka̱mu.<verse eid="MAT 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />&lt;&lt;Kwa buca bu yaba na oga bugyama ana bu esa. &lt;Goo busa bugyama bu soo u siri, bu hyan, &lt;Gya na bu yape utase una u gya na bu lagano zwama goo bu ni makaban ana gya bu yape. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ui iwo gama goo hoge yama i bugyama buna bu ga̱hi i yiwa na cigyama nga̱ gya na hoge? <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Na soo ubobo,kwa buca bu yaba buba na zwaman aco ai ibwana ukaba̱ u ci'incu ana a sugule bo, kwa bu cope utasae una aba lagano bo.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Yesu ni hin, &lt;&lt;Ina Buca abumui bu zaro bui ia̱gya kwa si bu yape a̱hun nahi na soo waba .&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">I hono i cigya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hogi i zwamaga ini, bu curi Galili kwa ni ali usala waba u Yahudiya na ukacaso un uwo u Yodan. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Aco dinyiya alaga bware, hinda bu hwingacume ga na mahuna maba apayi.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Haparisiyawa ha kore zwam ha gwaji Yesu. Ha hin, &lt;&lt;I cibago i cikarigo ci Musa i yaje buco curi bu'a bu buba harbuce? &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;I karancuwa nga̱ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hin na jigu Hwinsu i ga buco bu cware na bu'a? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Kwa Hwinsu na hin, &lt;Zwama haruni buco bui curi buca na amaci a buba a ma gami na bu'a, asa̱ ikanga̱ inka̱.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Ai sawa aco barya̱, ama buika̱, Zwama haruni ina Hwinsu uba gami, buco buta handgaga,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />&lt;&lt;Be san, aba kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Musa uba hin an buco bu pwan i pana bu'a utakada ui hono i cigya bu san bwa bu ali?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Musa ui yaje an i pan bu'a utakada ui hono i cigya zwama nagu hacube a ha̱hin, Sa harbuniyo uba yiwa na jigu. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Ne zwama buna bu a̱ce bu'a bu buba, kwa di si bu ia̱gu cidana, hinda si bu ze bu mewa bu yiwa ne ia̱ dala a cidana na buba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Kwa silmajiri na hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Si harbuniyo uba sa buco na bu'a bu buba, u kamace ma buco ta ia̱ cigya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu i cane &lt;&lt;Sa tigamba bui yaje na cikarigo cini, ama kwa aco na Hwinsu uba yaje ga. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Zwama a zaa i dinyiya una ui san buco bu cware buba za ia̱ cigya: acage, zwama a mace ga harbuni; cage hinda,aco abe a san ga harunɨ; acagiya aco hinda a yaje ana a zaa ia̱ cigya zwam cigwama ci zaro. Buna bu hyan bu yaje na cikarigo cini bu yaje.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saawo si noya na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Kwa aba na kule saawo si noya an Yesu dangi sa hinda bu ia̱gi sa ahunda̱. Kwa silmajiri na ka̱ri butana bware.<verse eid="MAT 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Kwa Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;Curya saawo si noya si kurya ahwamui, ita gazgana sa, zwam cigwama ci Hwinsu isa u siba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Nga̱ bware buba dangi sa na wa u buba, kwa bware na ala.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulagasa bu musare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Azaa buco buna bwa kore pa Yesu kwa na kaba̱ na, &lt;&lt;Walami, iri mamba i burya̠ gya na ia̱ ina gyamace gya ese yaba zaro ana aza ihogu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />&lt;&lt;Be san goo bu na kaba̱ na ina isa i burya̠?&gt;&gt; Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;be sa goo buni kaba̱ na ina gyamace, si bu gimbo ese yaba zaro ana zaa ihogu, lagan umurni u cikarigo ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />&lt;&lt;Unba uikan?&gt;&gt; Bu kaba̱ na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu kwa na cane, &lt;&lt;Ta huna buco, ta ia̱ga cidana, ta danga i buco, ta ia̱ sheda ina goo bui hyanuwa, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Pan buca na amaci cilabe caba, ka̱ri buna bu yiwa ciyabu na goo nga̱ icwa nibui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />&lt;&lt;Ini ka̱mu na igya,&gt;&gt; bulagasa bu hin, &lt;&lt;beya gya na gane ina gya na si iwo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu i cane &lt;&lt;Si bu ginbo i tibai na burya̱, ala, sang ka̱mu ina goo bu zaa goo pan ha talaka, bui hyan izana na zaro. Goo burya̠, na laganya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Nga̱ bulagasa buba hugi haruni, bu hacigage soo kwa na mawalan, zwam bu zaa izana dinyiya.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Kwa Yesu na hin na silmajiri sa bware, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda gya na zwama, u gagume buco bu musarya bu ese cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Na zwama hinda ui zana na sauki urakumi u ese na haisa ya ajimula na buco bu izana bu ese cigwama ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Nga̱ silmajiri siba hoge ini, iwasa i kumbe ga dinyiya kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Gamba ai ceci?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu i byane ga kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Pa buco uzaa ma ia̱, ama pa Hwinsu tibai i ma ia̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Bitrus a cane, &lt;&lt;Ci curi i ka̱mu zwama ci bu lagan! be ga̱ci ci hyan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu i hin naba, &lt;&lt;Na zwama kamahinda na cigwama cina ci yiwa korwo, hun Bwa bu Buwama bui madala na idalo i cilabe ci cigwama caba, ga̱hi buna i na laga i madala ihuga̱ i cigwama ci mudalo ikope na burya̱, hinda na ia̱gya sizwaga ikupe na harya ha Isra'ila sharia. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />ka̱mu buna bu curi yaba ko ahun ko bu'a ko buca ko amaci ko saawo ko inta zwama gya bui hin ina zake dari u ina buba nagi hinda bui re gajo a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Aco dinyiya ana asa jigu ai sana aco ikundagu, aco dinyiya assa kundagu ai san aco jigu.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Misali u aco ibwana na inta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />&lt;&lt;Cigwama ci Hwinsu ci nyaga na buco bu yaba buna bu sire ubungwa ma'inta zwam bu gimbaga aco ana ai hurya inta buba. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />nga̱ aba mashiri nga̱ bware buba bui cope musare na ihurumu kwa bware na halan ga na inta.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Na karfe utanasi kwa buba na sire na bangi acagiya aco na usala ukasuwa na dala ai hono isokoco. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Yesu i hin naba &lt;&lt;ga̱hi ma alaje iyi ibwana na inta, hinda na cupa ina kamace. <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Kwa aba na ala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">&lt;&lt;Bu gope i kore nga̱ awa ucunihi na hinda awa utanasi kwa bware na zwaman ga nga̱ bware buba ia̱gi aco jigu. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Na karfe uta bu sire kwa na bangi acagiya aco na dala harbuce kwa bware na kaba̱ ga, &lt;be san ga̱hi tun na ubungwa i yiwa na dala ai hono isokoco?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Zwama ci zaa buna bu ci zangi haya. A cane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:7">&lt;&lt;Bu hin naba, ga̱hi ma kulaje ibwana na inta numui.<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />&lt;&lt;Nga̱ uyinbe uba i, buhuzi bu inta bu angaryago, &lt;uganya aco ibwana cope ga musare mu ibwana, rwage na buna bwa kundagi hal kurwa u buna bu rwage ikuki.<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />&lt;&lt;Nga̱ aco na aba zangi ga ibwana na karpe ikope na uika̱ a ce musare mu ihurumu. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Nga̱ aco na rwage ikuki i ibwana a gimbaga sa musare mu aba mu zake muna mu aco ana a kuki kacuta̱. Ama kwa aba na cope musare mu ihurumu . <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Nga̱ aba ce, kwa aba na tadan hawonzoro. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />&lt;&lt;Aco na goo bu zangi haya wabkacuta ai ibwana a wa uika̱; aba hin, &lt;hinda goo bu san ga dede na ga̱ci buna ci hoge songorwo u hwinsu;<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />&lt;&lt;Hinda kwa buco bu inta ni cane buco buika̱, &lt;A'usa, nimui ai nabu cutuwo. Ci ma shiriwo na musare muna aba cupago na ihurumu? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Kwa buco bu inta na cane Zanga ina aba cope i ali. Na gimbo i cope buna bu gya na zangi ibwana i kacuta̱ ina gya nai pan. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Na jubuwa ia̱ ina gya na ka̱ri na musare a mumui? Ko bu dabe soo zwam gya na zaa suwa u burya̠?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Yesu na hin Zwam haruniyo aco kacuta̱ ai maringya jigu hinda jigu hinda a maringe kacuta̱&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu u i cikarigo u'o weba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Baniya Yesu eba na yina u kurwa bu kurwa Urshalima, bu zangi silmajiri si buba i kope na sirya kwa na hin na siba, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />&lt;&lt;Kubla je,&gt;&gt; bu hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ci ginbo i kore Urshalima, hinda Bwa bu Buwama ai pan bo na wa alabe labe na Hawalami ha icibago i Musa ai hune bware. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Hinda a kule bwa pa aco ana ai dakuwo Hwinsu zwama a same, a hone, a hinda jukai na u'on u masacu. Hun tacula bui masingya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ona wa amaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Kwa amaci a saawo si Zabadi na kurya pa Yesu na saawo saba, a kuztan na cinge, a gimbaga i pa bware.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Yesu ni hin be goo bu gimbago?&gt;&gt; Bu kaba̱ , kwa aba na hin, &lt;&lt;Na gimbo goo sana saawo sina asimui si madale na goo buika̱ na wa u cuga hinda bu cagiya na wa u gulo na cigwama nibui&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />&lt;&lt;Bui dakuwo ina goo bu gimbago,&gt;&gt; Yesu i zwama ga. I pwa i so miya na adanda ana i gya na ka̱ri so?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ci pwan,&gt;&gt; a cane. <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu zwama ga, &lt;&lt;Bui pwan i so pa adanda nimui, kwa di dala na wa u cuga na una u gulo sa gyamuya na pana i huga na isa i Buca abumui buna buba ka̱ri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Nga̱ silmajiri ikope siba hoge kwa soo u siba na hacigage na sihun saba barya. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Yesu i oga ga ka̱mu na ihuga̱ uika̱ kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;I daki ana mugwamgwam mu aco ana ai dakuwo Hwinsu, hinda aco labe aba sa cibe koce pa aco ba. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ama ga̱hi sa harbuni kwa di buna bu gimbo busa bulabe bu maisi icwa i buba bugyama, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Hinda buna bu gimbo busa bu jigu busa bugyama- <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Nga̱ Bwa bu Buwama bui kurya zwama a laga bwa ama bu laga, hinda bu pa a̱huru a buba zwam aco dinyiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arubu barya a hyanagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu na silmajiri saba aba na sire Yeriko, aco dinyiya kwa na lagana bware. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Arubu barya a madale na ugagi u yina, nga̱ aba hoge Yesu i yiwa na laga yina, kwa na danda bicwarwa, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba , Bwa bu Dauda, huga yama nuci!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Kwa aco na gimbago i butana ga ana a otani, ama kwa aba na jidana danda bicwarwa na koce, &lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba, Bwa bu Dauda, huga yama nuci!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu i yisan kwa na oga ga. &lt;&lt;Be ga̱hi i gimbo gya i ia̱gi?&gt;&gt; Bu kaba̱ . <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />&lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba&gt;&gt; a cane,&gt;&gt; ci gimbo ci hyanagya&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu i hoge yama yaba kwa na danga haisa haba. Kwa haisa haba na magunja. i sanuwo kwa aba na lagana bware.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu a ese Urshalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Nga̱ aba yaptana Urshalima, nga̱ aba wuci Betafaji ciyabu na a'ogo a e'on i zaitun, kwa Yesu na cumana silmajiri sirya̱ <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />kwa bware na hin, &lt;&lt;Alaje na suwa i'ogo ina ga̱hi i bangi aziyaki a noya na amaci aba palage na birigi na. Si i pasingi gahi ni kuliya. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Si bucahya bui kaba̱ , zwamana bo an bugwama bu doone Hwinsu bube bu gimba sa, bware buzaa sano bui ringesi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ini sinji ci zwamago ca acubago Hwinsu:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />&lt;&lt;Zwama aco i'ogo Urshalima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">&lt;hyan, bugwama abuhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">bu yiwa na korwo zata wa aziyaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">aziyaki a nuya,&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Silmajiri si kore kwa na ia̱gi nga̱ Yesu uba zwamaga. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />A kulage bware aziyaki a nuya na amaci aba, abare halapo haba kwa Yesu hinda zata. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Aco dinyiya a balage halapo na yina acage aco hinda a gundagi habwabwa ugyagya kwa na bare na yina. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Aco na sangi ala na aco na laga, a hinan na sana ci'ogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;Hosana pa Bwa bu Dauda!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;Unu u burya̠ pa buna bu yiwa na kore ni ize i bugwam bu doone!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;Hosana ube u zake na cilabe!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Nga̱ Yesu aba ese Urshalima, aco ka̱mu na i'ogo a hina wa̱wo kwa na kaba̱ na, &lt;&lt;Gambuni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Kwa aco na cane, &lt;&lt;Bube busa Yesu, acubago Hwinsu buna bu sire Nazaret ana a Galili.<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na suwa yaba ahunda̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu a ese na suwa yaba ahunda̱ bware bu ance ka̱mu aco na sang na sa. Bware bu kwamga ha tebur hana ha aco na ia̱ga canji musare na ha benci ha aco na sanga mutantabara <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Yesu i hin nab &lt;&lt;A rubuci&gt;&gt; Ai oge yaba numui yaba ya ahunda̱, &lt;&lt;I ringyaga &lt;yaba a'hya.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Arubu na agunu a kore pa bware na suwa u yaba ahunda̱, kwa bware na hwingacuma ga. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Nga̱ alabe labe yaba ahunda̱ na hawalami ha cibago i Musa aba hyan zwama mamaki hu bware buba i kwa saawo na san ci'ogo na suwa yaba ahunda̱, &lt;&lt;Hosana hwa Bwa bu Dauda,&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na dabe soo.<verse eid="MAT 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Bu huge ina saawo sina siba na zwamgana?&gt;&gt; A kaba̱ Yesu. Kwa Yesu na cane,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">&lt;&lt;Iniya̱,&gt;&gt; Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Yasa tabuwa karanta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">&lt;&lt; &lt;Na unu saawo si nuya na sina si swago mosubo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">sibe na pan cilabe,&gt;? &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Kwa Yesu na curya ga korwo i'ogo i Betani, kwa na bunge ahwayi.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">U'on u muco u padare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Na ubungwa ma'inta, bware na giwo korwo e'ogo, kwa imero na kumbe bware. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Nga̱ bware buba hyan u'on u muco na ugagi na yina, kwa bware ne kore bui banguwo imata i u'on kwa habonba. Kwa bware na hyan, &lt;&lt;Buzaa matakana hal ihogu!&gt;&gt; Kwa u'on muco na padal.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Nga̱ silmajiri siba hyan, ina iyi, iwasa i kombega. &lt;&lt;Neya u'on muco uba padare na mabuna?&gt;&gt; A kaba̱ .<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda ni zwama, si buzi itano soo bui iwo shaka, na soo buzaa ni maharha na ina aba ia̱gi u'on muco, bui pwa hyan na ia̱ga na, &lt;Ala matan na suwa uwo&gt; ui ma ia̱ga. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Si bu tano soo bui hyan ina ka̱mu buba kaba̱ na ahunda̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A i Makaba̱ ma Koce u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu a ese yaba ahunda̱; aba na cibaga, alabe labe yaba ahunda̱ na a'onga aba a kore pa bware na kaba̱n, &lt;&lt;Na koce gamba goo bu ia̱gu ina, bware. &lt;&lt;Gamba bu pan koce una goo bu ia̱gu ina? gamba buba yaje?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Kwa Yesu na cane, &lt;&lt;Gya ma na kaba̱ na makaba̱ muika̱. Si ini cane, gya ma ni zwaman na koce gamba gya ni ia̱ga ina. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Baptisma u Yohana a sire hu gamba? Usire na zaro ko pa aco?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Kwa aba na ma'uga kwa na makaba̱ na, &lt;Si ci hyan u sire na zaro&gt; Bware bui ci kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Be sa ga̱hi i izaa tano soo na bware?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Hinda si ci hyan, &lt;&lt;Ma sire pa aco ci yiwa ni huge iwasa ya aco, zwama a daki ka̱mu i Yohana busa acubago Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Kwa aba nai cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Ci dakuwo.&gt;&gt; Kwa bware na hyan naba gya ma na zaa zwam ko koce gamba gya na yiwa na ia̱ga ina.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misali u saawo sirya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />&lt;&lt;Be gahi hyan? A za bucahya buna buzaa saawo sirya. Bware bu hyan na buna bu jigu, ala iyi ibwana na inta.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Ni zaa i kore bware bu cane, nga̱ aba sana cimu kwa buba ni masake shawari kwa ni kore.<verse eid="MAT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />&lt;&lt;Kwa buca na kore pa bwa bu lagi kwa ni zwamani bwa nga̱ buba zwama buna bu jigu. Bu cane, &lt;Ni kore, hinda kwa buba ni wanje korwo.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />&lt;&lt;Ciki u saawo na sirya̱ buba bu iyi ina buca buba zwamaga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">&lt;&lt;Buna bu jigu,&gt;&gt; a cane bware.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Kwa Yesu ni hin nab &lt;&lt;Kamahinda ni zwama, aco icago i ganju na si karuwo ai zolaga na eso cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Zwam Yohana i kore nai ciba yina u burya̠, ya yajuwa na bware, ama aco icago i ganju na sikaruwa an tano soo. Hinda nga̱ ga̱hi hin, ina ka̱mu, i tanowa soo hinda i curuwo eewo.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali aco haya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />&lt;&lt;Kublaje misali u mewa: Yesu a hin. Aza buhuzi bu inta buna bu kabe inta. Kwa buba na ringani inta, kwa na ia̱ga ihuga̱ ipilangu imata inabi hinda kwa na ia̱ga katanga apayi. Kwa buba ni pangana aco haya u inta kwa ni mawalan cihano. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Nga̱ lokaci u gubo uba wuci, kwa buba cuma bugyama bu uba pa aco na ce inta haya bu ca imata u'on u inta.<verse eid="MAT 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />&lt;&lt;Kwa aco haya na kombe bugyama; A ia̱gi buika̱ ihuna, a hune bucage, kwa na taga buna bu tacula hatare. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Kwa buba na cuman agyama maiwa paba, ana zake na jigu, kwa aco yaha na ia̱gya ga nga̱ aba ia̱gi ana jigu. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Na Kacuta̱ ka̱mu, kwa bu na cuma bwa bu buba hwa aba. &lt;Kamahinda i huge mu'inya mu bwa bumui. Kwa buba na hin.<verse eid="MAT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />&lt;&lt;Nga̱ aco haya aba hyan bwa buba na kore, kwa aba na zwaman, &lt;Magaji ma bware amana na korwo. Koryaje, ci hune bwa ci zangi gajo ububa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Kwa aba na zangi bwa, kwa na silacuma bwa na inta kwa na hune bwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />&lt;&lt;Zwama nga̱ buhuzi bu inta buba bwa kore, ia̱gya buba bui ia̱gya aco haya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />&lt;&lt;Yesu i hunaga aco ini cidana,&gt;&gt; Kwa aba ni cane, &lt;&lt;Bware bui pana cage aco haya u inta, ana i pana bware habi ina aba gubi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba &lt;&lt;Yasa taba i karanta na cikarigo ci Hwinsu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">&lt;&lt; &lt;Utare una aco ema aba wonje ube</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">wasano ipicu ema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Hwinsu ube iyi haruni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">Hinda isa iyi mamaki na hisa ahaci&gt;?<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />&lt;&lt;Zwama harbuni ni zwama yaba cigwama ci Hwinsu i caga na wa nuhi apa aco na i pana imata. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Buna bu maginji ni utare una bui ma bubsaga, hinda buna bu tare wa hene pa buba wai namaga bwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Nga̱ alabe a yaba ahunda̱ na Haparisiyawa haba huge misali u Yesu, a daki ana bware ni ia̱ga naba. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Kwa aba na gimbaga ina i sana aba ikumbe bware, kwa aba na hoge iwasa zwama aco a daki ana bware busa acubago Hwinsu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Misali lago u cigya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu i jidane ia̱gyaga cikarigo na misali, kwa na hin: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />&lt;&lt;Cigwama ci Hwinsu ci nyaga na bugwama buna bu ka̱ri ia̱gya bwa bu iba cigya. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Kwa iba na cumana bugyama bu iba bu ugana aco ana ibu gimba a kurya pa lago u cigya, kwa aba na wanje korwo.<verse eid="MAT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />&lt;&lt;Kwa iba na jidana cuman agyama maiwa, &lt;Zwama aco na gya na ugan ana ni hogu kimgana ihuga̱ ire mare: na bacige i curi na naa ina awagalagi, hinda ahogu tibai. Kuryaje ipalanu u cigya.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />&lt;&lt;Hinda a canuwa kwa aba na mawalan buna bu kore pa inta buba bucage hinda makula pa ibwana buba. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />A cage hinda a kumbage agyama buba a ia̱gyaga ihuna, ala jiga huna kwa na hunagaga. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Soo bugwama kwa na dabe. Kwa buba na cumana mu soja a hunage aco ne hunega hinda acubi i'ogo yaba ula.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />&lt;&lt;Kwa bware na hin na agyama, &lt;Lago u cigya u wuco hinda aco na gya na uga a wanje kurwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Zwam haruni Kuleje na hayina buna bu ga̱hi i hyan i uganyaga.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Kwa agyama na sire na hayina kwa na tanaga aco na bu hin, na aco burya̠ na aco eewo ukaba u lago na sinji na hanyagata.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />&lt;&lt;Nga̱ bugwama buba ese kwa na hin hanyagata kwa buba na bisika bucahya buna bui mabwadanowa hazunga ha lago. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />&lt;A'usa,&gt; bu kaba̱ , &lt;Naiya goo bu isa piyi goo abuna buzaa hazunga ha lago? Bware bu nagi na cikarigo.<verse eid="MAT 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />&lt;&lt;Kwa bugwama na zwamana aco ibwana buba, &lt;Palagaje bware buna na siwa, i kwama bware ni ijapu, na suwa ci'incu, ihuga̱ cidaro na ciha̱ka̱ ci haila.<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />&lt;&lt;A uga aco dinyiya, a zangi aco cimu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I cupo i ganju pa kaisar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Kwa Haparisiyawa ha kore kwa na gimbo u yina nga̱ aba ai kumbe bware na magwata̱ pa cikarigo ci bware. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Kwa aba na cuman silmajiri saba na aco Hiridus. &lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na hin, &lt;&lt;Walami, ci daki busa buco bu kamahinda bu yiwa na cibaga yina Hwinsu u burya̠ . Bui na lagana cikarigo ci aco hinda bu zangi aco asa buika̱. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Ci zwama bane ina i yiwa na soo nubui? U kamace ci cupe ganju pa Kaisar ko cita cupa?<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Hinda Yesu i daki ka̱mu eewo yaba, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi malapukai, be sa ga̱hi cibagi kaciba i ka̱ri na kumbo? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Ni cibeyaje musare mu ga̱hi icupagu ganju.&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na kulage bware musare mu aba, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Kwa Yesu ni kaba̱ na ga, &lt;&lt;Sinu gambuna na musare? Hinda ize gambuna i yiwa suwa musare?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />&lt;&lt;Sinu Kaisar&gt;&gt;, a cane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Kwa bware na hin naba, &lt;&lt;panaje Kaisar ina sa Kaisar, hinda pa Hwinsu ina sa Hwinsu,<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Nga̱ aba hoge haruni, kwa na makumba uno kwa aba na curo bware kwa aba na malana.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cigya na wasingo u'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Huni Hasadaukiyawa, hana hin wasengewo aco na kwadaga uzaa, a kore pa Yesu na makaba̱ . <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />&lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Musa uci zwama ana si buco bu kwaji bui macuwa saawo, buhun bu buba bu swatan bu'a bu buba zwama aba hyangi bo saawo. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Baniya aco na sihun caba tandarya̱ ahwaci. Buna bu jigu bu'i cigya kwa buba ni kwaji, hinda bui macuwa saawo kwa buhun na swatan. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Harbuni buna bu lagi na buna bu tacula, hal wuti buna bu tandarya̱. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />I hogi ka̱mu, kwa bu'a na kwaji. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Baniya, hun wasengewo aco na kwadagi bui sana bu'a bu gamba pa ahun tandarya, zwama ka̱mu waba azi bu'a?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Kwa Yesu na cane ga &lt;&lt;I inage zwama ya dakuwo cikarigo ci Hwinsu ko koce u Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Na wasengewo aco na kwadaga, aco a zaa pan cigya a zaa hinda ia̱ga cigya i san nga̱ acuma a Hwinsu na zaro. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Hinda zwama i wasengewo aco ana kwaji, ya karancuwa ina Hwinsu uba hin na ga̱hi? <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />&lt;Gyamui na si Hwinsu u ibrahim na Hwinsu na u Ishaku, hinda na Hwinsu Yakub?&gt; Wuisa Hwinsu aco na kwadagi ama Hwinsu aco na i yiwa na muhonjo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Nga̱ aco ba hoge, a hoge mamaki na icibagu i bware .<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cikarigo cina ci zake moso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Nga̱ aba hoge Yesu u kubtana uno Hasadaukiyawa kwa ha Haparisiyawa na matanagan. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Buco buika̱, buna bu daki cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci Musa, kwa na gwaji bware na makaba̱ an:<verse eid="MAT 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />&lt;&lt;Walami, cimba cikarigo ci Hwinsu cisa ci labe ciki umurni na icibago i Musa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Kwa Yesu na cane &lt;&lt; &lt;Ka̱la̱ bugwama Hwinsu na soo na bui na a̱huru nibui na koce nibui&gt;. <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ube usa umurni u cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci jigu ci labe. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Cina ci lagi ci nyaga na ciba: &lt;Ka̱la̠ buna bu ga̱hi ima yabtaga na buba nga̱ goo bu ka̱ri icwa nibui&gt;. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Ka̱mu cikarigo ci Musa na icibago ya acubago Hwinsu ci yiwa apani pa umurni na cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwa bu gamba busa kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Nga̱ Haparisiyawa ha matanagan, kwa Yesu na kaba̱ naga, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />&lt;&lt;beya ga̱hi hin na Kristi? Busa bwa bu gamba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">&lt;&lt;Bwa bu Dauda,&gt;&gt; A cane.<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Kwa Yesu na hin nab, &lt;&lt;Naiya Dauda, uba yiwa na ia̱ga cikarigo na a̱huru, u uga bware &lt;Buca̱ bu yaba&gt;? Bware bu hin,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Hwinsu u hyan bugwama bu doone abumui:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">&lt;&lt;madale na wa numui u cuga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">kwa na sa aco na bu wanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">hal punjigiga.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Si Dauda uga bware &lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu,&gt; Naiya buba bui san bwa bu bware?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Azaa buna bui pwa cane bware, tun huni azaa buna bu kaba̱ ka bware ihya.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yama utandarya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Yesu hin na aco dinyiya na silmajiri si bware: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />&lt;&lt;Hawalami ha cikarigo ci Musa na Haparisiyawa si madale na idalo i Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />U san dole i iyi ina aba hin na ga̱hi ka̱mu. ga̱hi ita ia̱ga ina aba ia̱ga, zwama a ia̱gago ina aba cibago. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Apalage icwana i mure kwa na cwagya aco na icwa yaba, aba na icwa yaba a ka̱ruwo banganiga ko na ibwabwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱mu ina aba ia̱ga zwama aco hyanga: si ma palga cikarigo ci Hwinsu na sinu yaba si pala birigi bini bi zangari na cilapo caba; <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />A ka̱ri ihuga̱ na aba panago ga cilabe na ihuga̱ lago na mudalo mu labe na ukaba̱ ahunda̱; <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />A ka̱ri usanganu na kasuwa aco na uganaga &lt;Hawalami ha labe.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />&lt;&lt;Hinda gahi ata ugana &lt;Hawalami,&gt; zwama izaa buca bu yaba buika̱ hinda iha̱wunga̱ ka̱mu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Ita ugana buca na doone &lt;Buca,&gt; zwama izaa Buca buika̱ hinda bware bu yiwa na zaro. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />A zaa na ugan &lt;walami,&gt; zwama izaa walami uika, ubi usa Kristi. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Buna busa bulabe na ga̱hi bube bui sana bugyama. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Hinda buna bu pa icwa buba cilabe bui san bugyama, buna maisi icwa buba bugyama bui san bulabe.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Yama nubui, hawalami na Haparisiyawa, ga̱hi malapukai! I gundagi aco esa cigwama ci Hwinsu ga̱hi na icwa nuhi ya isuwa, ga̱hi hinda ya curuwo aco na ka̱ri isa. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Yama nuhi hawalami na haparisiyawa, aco na cage sa'a sina si nagi sare yaba, hinda a yiwa na ia̱ga ahunda̱ dinyiya. Zwama harbuni ai sungulaga dinyiya.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Yama nuhi hawalami na Haparisiyawa ga̱hi malapukai: Si ia̱ cihano na cinge na uwo zwama ga̱hi hin alagan, si bu sana bulagano abuhi iyi san bwa bu sana bwa bu ula nga̱ gahi isa.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Yama nuhi ga̱hi rubo na ga̱hi si kaji: i hin, si buco macone na yaba ahunda̱ na zinariya u yaba ahunda̱, kucuna ku kumbo ga.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Ga̱hi arubo aco na zaa mahasa! Humba zake: i zinariya, kodi yaba ahunda̱ ina sa izinariya ina ukaba̱ ahunda̱ una u san zinariya na nagu ciri? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Nga̱ ga̱hi hinda i hin, &lt;Si bucahya macune na ukaba̱ wa a̱hunda, wa sanuwa ihya; si buco bu ma cune ina aba pa sadaka, kucuna ku kumbega.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Ga̱hi rubu! Umba u zake, daje ko hinda ukaba̱ wa ahunda̱ mana mazaa ciri? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Zwam harbuniyo buna bu macune na ukaba wa ahunda̱, na ina yiwa na suwa ka̱mu. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Buna bu macune na yaba ahunda̱ macune na iba na buna bu yiwa soo iba. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Buna bu macune na zaro bu macune na cigwama ci Hwinsu na buna bu madale na iba.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Yama nuhi hawalami a icibago cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci Musa na Haparisiyawa, malapukai! Si pa sadaka na ucita, na habonba. Kwa ga̱hi na curi ina zake na kamahinda, yama na itano soo, zwama burya̠ . Ina bini wa kamace ga̱hi ia̱gi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />ga̱hi a kaju rubo! Si zagtangi asu aba naki urakumi.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Yama nuhi, hawalami na Haparisiyawa, malapukai! Si guzagi ijapu ikopi na ikwano ga̱hi curi wa na ciri. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Arubu Haparisiyawa! Ni jigu guzagu na suwa adanda na ihongwa, ijapu i ma guzaga.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />&lt;&lt;Yama nuhi, hawalami na Haparisiyawa, malapukai! Ayiwa nga̱ hazin hana haba subtage penti mu gyamace ni japu na suwa i sindagi na ha upan ha aco na ha kwadaga ti iri camba ciri u sinji. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Harbuni hinda, ga̱hi i isa pa aco ijapu nga̱ aco burya̠, hinda na soo nuhi kwa malapunci na eewo<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />&lt;&lt;Yama nuhi, hawalami na Haparisiyawa ga̱hi malapukai! Si gabe hazin pa acubago Hwinsu i kimga muzi mu aco nagu ciri. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Ga̱hi si hin, si ci yanse, huna aco na matange hacaca, ca zaa tana wa na jigu mahya acubago Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Harbuni ga̱hi cibe icwa nuhi ga̱hi isa saawo sa aco na ahunage acubago Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Sindaje, i mani iyi eewo ca ana matange hacaca ahahi!<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />&lt;&lt;Ga̱hi sihwa! Sawoo si hakuba neya ga̱hi i macyaga isu ula? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Zwama haruni ni cuma acubago a Hwinsu na aco mahasa na hawalami. I hune hinda i jukai cage; cage i supi ga na ukaba ahunda̱ <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ni cuman mahin ma aco nagu ciri mana aba jigi na doone, korwo mahya ma buco bu burya̠ Habila na mahin ma Zakariya bwa bu Berekiya, buna bu ga̱hi i hone na suwa wai yaba ahunda̱ na suwa ukaba wa ahunda̱. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Kamahinda na zwama, ka̱mu zwama niya wi bangi aco zamani na.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />&lt;&lt;O Urshalima, Urshalima bu hone acubago Hwinsu kwa ga̱hi na tage ga na hatare, hal naiya gya ni sana ni tanagana saawo si mui, nga̱ waruma uba si tanaga saawo si uba na habab, ama i ka̱ruwo. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Byana, iyaba nuhi izawa ihya. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Kamahinda na zwama, izaa na hyanakana hinda kwa i hin, unu u burya̠ usa pa buco buna bo kore na izi Hwinsu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Icibago ihogu i doone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Nga̱ Yesu iba curi yaba ahunda̱ iba ni ala kwa silmajiri si bware na ugan bware zwama si cibe bware ema i muginga. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />&lt;&lt;I hyan ka̱mu ina?&gt;&gt; Bware bu kaba̱ .&lt;&lt;Kamahinda ni zwama, ko tare uika̱ azaa una aba ai curya zata ucagiya; ai huzi tibai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu kwa a madale na a'ogo a e'on i zaitun, kwa silmajiri si bware ni makumbulana pa bware. &lt;&lt;Ci zwama,&gt;&gt; aba hin bimba ina eba i kore, hinda be ui san alama kurwa nibui u lagi na ihogu u doone.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Masikai bucahya buta inacuma. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Aco dinyiya, ai kore na ize nimui, i hyan, &lt;Abe asa Kristi.&gt; Hinda ai inacuma aco dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Ai hugi ijumu i gasa, ita huga iwasa. Zwama dole iniya̱ i pal, ama ihuga̱ i doone yasi korya. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />E'ogo i kulatan i'ogo, hinda mugwamgwam mui kultan mugwamgwam, i ia̱ga imero na ijumu i cinge tuhonba. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ini ka̱mu ibe isa jigu sungurwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />&lt;&lt;Ai kulaga pa mugwamgwam hinda mai hune hinda hal ai hune, hinda i'ogo dinyiya ci wundaga zwama gya. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Aco dinyiya ai curya na lagan Hwinsu hal ma wundage, <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Acubago cibya ai sire ni huga dinyiya i hyan lagan dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Zwama eewo i ma jidagano, maka̠la̠ ma aco mai macoka̠n, <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Ama buna bu yisa na koce hal ihogu ai ceci bo. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Cikarigo ci cigwama ci Hwinsu i cibaga ka̠mu hwa aco doone zwam u san sheda pa i'ogo ka̱mu hinda i gunja hisa pa aco ka̠mu, apani ihogu ibe i kore.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />&lt;&lt;I hin zwam u cidana una ui kuli u'o una u bucubago bu Hwinsu Daniyel aba hin, bu yinsa pa ihuga̱ i nagu ciri. buna bu yiwa na karanta bu daki. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Aco na ayiwa na Yahudiya a some kore i'ogo. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Buna bu yiwa zata ni sumu i yaba buba buta kanziga an bu ka̱ri zanga i na yaba. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Buna bu yiwa na inta buta maringya na yaba ana bu gimbo zangi cilapo. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Na yiwa na hoge yama sa'a si mukaba̱ na sina si i yiwa na yaba. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ia̱ga je ahunda̱ munda amahi mata sana na halabuwa ko hun asabar. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Ni hun niya sungurya wui yana dinyiya, na korwo irwagu i doone hal korwo baniya aza gupaga ia̱ga iri buba. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Zwama aba caka mohon muniya azaa hyan buco buna bui yan na a̱huru. Hinda zwama aco na azi soo u burya̠ ana aba tanga ube usa aba i cakana̱. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />&lt;&lt;Na honiya ka̱mu buna bu hin na goo, &lt;Byana, Kristi bana!&gt; Ko, &lt;bware abuya!&gt; Ta yada . <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kristi a cibya na acubago cibya i sire, hinda i ciba i mamaki dinyiya hinda ai inacuma hal ma aco na aba tangagi-sa u ia̱ga dede. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Byan, ni zwaman kapi hone.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />&lt;&lt;Zwama ko a hin na ga̱hi, &lt;&lt;bware abe, na hila̱,&gt; Nga̱ walkiya a sila; ko, &lt;Bware abuna, na okaba u suwa,&gt; ita yada <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Nga̱ imazku u bita uba su sirya zata hinda a hyan kurwa na imiya, harbuniyo uringuwo u Bwa bu Buwama ube ui san. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />I huga ina i muse uba yiwa ahwayo hawunku haba i matanagan.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />&lt;&lt;Aba ni hoga wahala u mohon muni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">&lt;&lt; &lt;Hwinsu wui pan ci'incu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">hinda pyana uzaa i pana malanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">muginga mui hine na zaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">hinda koce zaro i majungutan.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />&lt;&lt;Lokaci uniya alama ai ringuwa i Bwa bu Buwama i hyan zata u zaro, mu'ogo mu cinge ka̱mu mui huge yama. I hin Bwa bu Buwama bui ni maringiya zata u zaro na koce ni izangacu dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Hinda bui cuman acuma a Hwinsu uba si hula sirewa na koce hinda si tanagana aco aba tanga na hasala na yaba zaro na imiya doone kurwa wa u cuga na una ugulo.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />&lt;&lt;Bane ia̱ koyi na u'on muco; si silacuma habonba i daki an siyo yabutano. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Harbuni, si i hin kami ini, idaki ana i yabtano ciyabu na i'iba. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Kamahinda ni zwama, aco zamani una baniya azaa kwaji kwa a hin iniya̱ na hisa haba. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Zaro ni cinge ui ala, ama cikarigo acimui cizaa ala.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I dakuwo na hon niya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />&lt;A zaa buna bu daki hon na hon, Ko acuma a Hwinsu na zaro, ko Bwa bu Hwinsu kwa Buca. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Nga̱ buba Hon Nuhu, harbuni uba ui san na ringuwa i Bwa bu Buwama. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Nga̱ uba sase kapi kurwa miyi, aco yanse na re na so na ia̱ga cigya na kulage cigya, hal kurwa hon nuhu uba ese jirgi u miya i labe. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Hinda i dakuwo ihya ina i ia̱ga naba kwa kurwa miya ma tupana ma kurya ma ali naba. Harbuni uba ui san u ringuwa u Bwa bu Buwama. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Aco barya i yana na ita; i zangi buco buika̱ a curi buika̱. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Si'a sirya siba na cinamo na hinwo ai zangi buika̱ a curi buika̱.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />&lt;&lt;Zwama harbuniyo apanije, zwama bui dakuwo huna bugwama bu doone Hwinsu buba bui korya. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Hinda dakaje una: si buhuzi bu yaba bu daki hon u buhya buba bui kore na gita bui a̱pana bu zaa i kure lapta hinda buza yaje a isa na yaba. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Zwama harbuni i yana je na cidaka̱, zwama Bwa bu Buwama bui kurya lokaci una gahi i dakuwo ani bui kurya.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />&lt;&lt;Gamba busa buco bu burya̠ na bugyama bu mahasa, buna bu buca bu yaba buba tanib byane yaba ka̱mu bui paniga mare na lokaci una ya kamace.? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Wui ia̱ga gama pa bugyama buna bu buca bu yaba buba bui bangya bwa ni ia̱ga ini gyamace. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Kamahinda ni zwama ni tani bware bu apa ka̱mu ini goo buzaa. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Si bugyama buni busa buco bu eewo bu zwama icwa buba, &lt;Buca bu yaba abumui bu ka̱ri san buzaa giwo ma'inta̱&gt;, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />kwa buba na hunaga acagiya agyama bu re bu su na aco na swago. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Buca bu yaba bu bugyama bui giwo na huna buba dakuwo na giwo buba. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Buca bu yaba bui ia̱ga hukunci pa ha malapukai i gundagaga ba i tanagoga na malapukai, i huga ina aba i huge cidaro na ciha̱ka̱ ci haila.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Misali mu ikangaza kope</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />&lt; Harbuni cigwama ci zaro ciba ci yan nga̱ mukangaza muna ta dakuwo buco i kope tiyemba zangi apicila a iba a kore a̱pe u ango. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Mukangaza muna ta dakuwo buco muta muzaa mahasa muta hinda muzaa mahasa. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Muna muzaa mahasa mu zangi si apicila ai zanguwo manube dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Muna mu mahasa a zangi manube na ukwalaba na ha picila haba dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Ango a sani a kurya ma inta, kwa malabo na kumbega kwa aba na lapta.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />&lt;&lt;Ni usa u gita kwa ni hoge ogo: Ango bana awuco kuryaje i bangi bware!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱mu kwa mukangaza muna ta dakuwo buco ni masinga kwa ni kimgana ha apicila. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Kwa muna muza mahasa kwa ni hin na muna muzaa mahasa ci takiyoji manube zwama apicila nacu a ka̱ri kwaji.<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Aye, kwa aba na cane, mazaa na ci jube ka̱mu nuciya zwama harbuniyo maringyaje hwa aco ni sanga manube i sanya̱.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />&lt;&lt;Nga̱ muna muzaa mahasa muba ali isan manube, Ango kwa ni wuci. Mukangaza muna mu mashiri mu ese tare na ango pa cigya. Kwa aba ni gundan i'iba.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />&lt;&lt;Ni bisani muta kwa ni kore &lt;Buca bu labe! Buca bu labe!&gt; Kwa aba hin &lt;Ci gunje i'eba ca ese!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />&lt;Kwa ango ni cane, &lt;Kamahinda nai dakuwo.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />&lt;&lt;Na hogu a̱panaji, zwama ai dakuwo hwinsu ko hun Bwa buwoma buba bui kurya.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misali u Buco bu Burya̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Hinda yaba i zaro ai sana nga̱ bucahya buna bu ka̱ri ia̱ cihano, buna bu ugan agyama buba kwa ni cutaniga izana buba. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Buna bu jigu bu pa bwa talent utah a musare, buna bu lagya talent arya buna bu tacula talent uika̱ tubomba dede na koce buba kwa buba na ma alani na cihano. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Buna aba pa talent atah bu tani musare hwa ibwana bu hin riba talent atah. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Harbuni, buna aba pa talent arya buba ma u hin talent arya. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Kwa bugyama buna aba pa talent uika̱ bu kore kwa ni gabe hambi kwa ni wumbana musare buca bu yaba na cinge.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Nga̱ aba sani kwa buca bu yaba bugyama kwa ni maringe zwam i korwoco na musare muna buba paga. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Buna bu ce talent atah bu kuliya riba atah. &lt;Buca bu yaba,&gt; bu hin, &lt;Buna pa talent atah, hyana̱, ni hinwo riba atah.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Kwa buco bu yaba ni cane &lt;Sanu ni ibwana, bugyama bu burya̠ ! Bu iyi ibwana ni burya̠ ni ina gya na bu pa cimu; ni bu pan i dinyiya bane. Kurya huge laco ni buca bu yaba abubui!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />&lt;&lt;Buna bu talent arya hinda kwa ne kore. &lt;Buca bu yaba,&gt; Bu hin, kwa ni hin, &lt;Buni pa talent arya; hyano, ni hin riba talent arya.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />&lt;&lt;Kwa buco bu yaba ni cane, sanu ni ibwana, &lt;Bugyama bu burya̠ bu i ibwana ni burya̠ ni cimu ni bu pan i dinyiya bane. Kurya huge laco ni buca bu yaba abubui! <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />&lt;&lt;Bugyama Buna aba pa talent uika bu kore Buca̱ bu yaba, &lt;Buca̱ bu yaba,&gt; bu hin, &lt;Ni daki bu gagume zwam si i gubi huguni goo bui kabuwa, bu tanago huguni goo bui jiguwo birwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Zwam harbuniyo gya ni hugi iwasa nibui ni swin talent nabu ni cinge. ca, ina goo buna pa bina.<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />&lt;&lt;Kwa buca bu yaba ni cane, goo bugyama bu eewo malalaci a bugyama bu daki si gubi ina gya na kabe hugo ina gya na jiguwo? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Bwa ni tagya musare amamui ni ihuga̱ ci'iru si ni maringiya ini tagya musare amumui na riba. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Caje talent na wa u bware i pa buna bu zaa talent i kupe. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ka̱mu buna buzi i jidana bo dinyiya, hinda buna buzaa ina buba zi i caga bo. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />A kwama bugyama bu eewo ahwayo ni ijapu, ihuga̱ i ci'incu, i huga ina isa cidaro ni ciha̱ka̱ ci haila.<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hatami na Harwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />&lt;&lt;Hun na Bwa bu Buwama buba bui kore na cigwama ka̱mu si acuma a Hwinsu tare na bware, bui madalan ni idalo i cigwama cilabe. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Aco i'ogo ka̱mu si matanaga pa bware, bware bui gwabgyaga aco nga̱ buhubo hatami si gwabgyaga hatami na harwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Bware bui tana hatami na wa u cuga harwa na wa gulo.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />&lt;&lt;Bugwama bui hin na aco ni iyiwo wa u cuga, kurwoje, ga̱hi buna Buca abumui bu tane unu u burya̠; zangaje gado nimui, cigwama ci aba iri tun ni jigu ni iwo u doone. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Zwam ni yanse ni imerwa ini pa mare ni re, gya ni ci'unya ina pan miya na so, gya unyagata ina pa ihuga̱ i malabo, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Na zanuwa hazunga hai bwadano ini pa hazuga, gya ni mahuna ini byane ni maba ni yans ni ukaba u ci'incu i kore ni hyan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />&lt;&lt;Aco nagu ciri i cane bware, &lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu bimba goo bu hyan goo ni imerwa ga̱ci bu pa mare, ni ci'unya gacu i pa miyi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Bimba ga̱ci bu hyan goo unyagata gacu bu iso ni yaba, ni nagu hazunga gacu bu pa hazunga, <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Bimba ga̱ci bu hyan bwa hugowa laco ko ni ukaba u ci'incu goo bu kore bu hyan?<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />&lt;&lt;Bugwama bui cane, &lt;Kamahinda ni zwama, ini ga̠hi i pa buna buhun, gyamui ga̠hi ini ia̱gi.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />&lt;&lt;Bware bui hin ni una wa u gulo, &lt;Masingije ahwamui, ga̱hi aco magwata̱, ni suwa ula ana aza ihogu na aba iri zwama buco bu eewo na acuma a bware. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Ni yans ni imero ya ni panuwa mare, ni yans na ci ui ya ni panuwa miya na so. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Ni sase unyagata, ya ni isuwa ni yaba nuhi. ni zaa hazunga, ya ni panuwa. ni isi mahuna hina ni suwa ukaba u ci'incu, ya ni byanuwa.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />&lt;&lt;Aba ma ai cane bware, &lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, bimba ga̱ci hya ni imerwa ko goo unyagata ko buzaa cilapo ko mahuna ko na ukaba u ci'incu, ga̱cu ca bu temakuwo?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />&lt;&lt;Bugwama bui cane, &lt;Kamahinda ni zwama, ini ga̠hi iwo wa buna bu no pa bu i, gyamui ga̠hi ya ni ia̱giwo.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />&lt;&lt;Yesu i hin ese ahwayo na ula, hinda aco nagu magwata̱ ai ese ihuga̱ i hupacu ana aza ihogu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Haparisiyawa ha ka̱ri hune Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Nga̱ Yesu aba hogi i zwamaga cikarigo cini, bware bu hin na silmajiri si bware, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Nga̱ ga̱hi idaki, lago we kacigago usigane mohon murya-hinda bucahya bui pan Bwa bu Buwama pa aco zwama jukai na u'on masacu bwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Kwa alabe labe na aco labe aco matanaga na suwa u iginga bulabe bulabe, ize i buba Kayapa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Hinda ai cikarigo na ciswin nga̱ aba ai konbe Yesu a hone bware. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />&lt;&lt;Ama sa hon u lago,&gt;&gt; a hin, &lt;&lt;Zwam aco ai pwan a asinga cuhuri pa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A sukotage Yesu manobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu iba na betani na yaba idage hya ina aba yiwa na ia̱gi Saminu idage, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />kwa bu'a ni kurya pa bware ni ikwalaba i manube mana aba ia̱gya na utare u onis ma musare dinyiya mana ma nyaga na tulare kwa na halan bware na icwa buba na re mare .<verse eid="MAT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Nga̠ silmajiri siba hyan, kwa siba̱ na hacigaga soo kwa na mazwaman. &lt;&lt;Be san i hacigago iri una?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Manube mana ai sanga a pana aco na zaa ihya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />nga̠ bware buba hoge ina aba yiwa na mazwaman, Yesu kwa na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ga̠hi i yiwa dama bu'a buna? Ina buba ni ia̱gi sa i burya̠ . <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Aco na zaa ihya a yiwa tare na ga̠hi tuhumba, ama izaa ni gya tohonba. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Nga̱ iba shukotag tulare mana ikanga̱ , bu i zwama buna kimga iwunbanu nimui. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Kamahinda na zwama, ihuga̱ ina aba zwamage cikarigo ci burya̠ cina na doone, ina buba i ai zwamagana, zwama a mabutaryage ina buba i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Juda i yaji cibaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Kwa Yahuda Iskariyoti ciki u silmajiri ikope na sirya-buna yaje-i kure pa bulabe bulabe <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />kwa na kaba̱, &lt;&lt;Be ga̱hi ina pan sini cibe bware?&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na pan ga azurpa a musare kope hataco. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Tun hone Yahuda iskariyoti i hina na gimbaga yina ana a bware buba bui cibaga Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ire mare ma Buca bu yaba ma ikacikago</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Hon jigu u lago u burodi una uzaa yisti, kwa silmajiri na korya pa Yesu na kaba̱ na, &lt;&lt;Homba goo bu ginbo ci kimga ihuga̱ ina goo bui re mare ma lago we kacigago?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yesu i cane, alaje suwa we i'ogo i bangi buco i hin na buba, &lt;walami u hin: lokaci nimui u yabutano. Ci ginbo re mare ma lago we kacigago na silmajiri a simui na yaba nibui.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Kwa silmajiri na ia̱ga nga̱ Yesu eba zwama sa kwa na kimgana ihuga̱ i mare ma lago we kacigago.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Nga̱ uyinbe uba i, kwa Yesu i madale na silmajiri ikope na sirya̱. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Aba na re mare, kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, buco buika̱ bo ka̱ri na cutan na wa aco na ka̱ri na hona.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />I damega na soo ka̱mu, kwa tigaba ni hinana kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;Gyamui pya bugwama bu doone Hwinsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;una bu ga̱ci yiwa na re mare na ikwano uika̱ na buba bube bui na cutan. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Bwa bu Buwama bui kwaji nga̱ aba zwamage an bui kwaji. Yama pa buco buna bu ka̱ri cutan Bwa bu Buwama! Wai zakan buco buni si ma si a tamacuwa bwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Kwa Yahuda, ina i ka̱ri cutan bware, na hin, &lt;&lt;Walami, sa di gyamuya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu i cane , &lt;&lt;Harbuni, gabui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Aba ne re mare, Yesu i zangaci burodi, bu goji Hwinsu kwa na busaga, kwa na pan silmajiri sa bware, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Ca je; usa ikanga̱ nimui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Kwa Yesu ni zangi adanda, a goji Hwinsu kwa ni pan ga, na hin, &lt;&lt;Iso je, ka̱mu nuhi. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Mahya amamui amana kucuna, mana ma jigu zwama a yape magwata̱ ma aco dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Yesu a hin, na zaa isoo miya ma saawo si inabi kwa hun na uga ne soo na ga̱hi mapu na cigwama ci Buca abumui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Kwa aba na zuge hazuga, kwa aba na yidana a'ogo a e'on i zaitun.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu u i cikarigo ci wanje u Bitrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Na gita nawuya ka̱mu nuhi i ia̱ magwata̱ zwam gya, zwam a rubuci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">&lt;&lt; &lt;Na busgya buhubo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">garke u hatami mapusi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Hinda si na masinge, na rwaga korwo Galili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Kwa Bitrus na cane, sa aco ka̱mu ese magwata̱ zwama goo, sa ka̱mu na gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />&lt;&lt;Kamahinda na bu zwama, &lt;&lt;Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Na gita nawuya, kapi uka̱ri u uga, bui hin an bui na dakuwo hal kataco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Kwa Bitrus na cane, &lt;&lt;Kwa di ci kwaji na goo, na zaa hin an nibui dakuwo.&gt;&gt; Kwa silmajiri mewa ni zwame nga̱ Bitrus aba hin.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A̱hunda a Yesu na Getsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Kwa Yesu na kore na silmajiri si bware na ihuga̱ ina aba ogo Getsemani, kwa ni hin nab, &lt;&lt;Madaleje a̱pi gya kore ahwa i ahunda̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Yesu zangi Bitrus na saawo sirya sa zabadi, soo u bware u hacigage dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Yesu hin naba, &lt;&lt;Soo nimui u hacigage dinyiya hal ma nga̱ ni ka̱ri kwaji. I sanje a̱pi tare ni gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Nga̱ Yesu iba madajigane cimu, kwa buba ni kuzata sinu bware ni cinge na ia̱ga ahunda̱, &lt;&lt;Buca abumui, si ema ia̱, zangaca adanda na ahwamui. Sa nga̱ gya ni ginbo, kwa nga̱ goo bu ginbo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Nga̱ Yesu uba maringe pa silmajiri si bware kwa buba bangi ga na malabo. &lt;&lt;Izaa pwan ia̱ a̱pe na gya ko ma awa uika&gt;&gt;? bu kaba̱ Bitrus. <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />&lt;&lt;Yisanje i ia̱ ahunda̱ zwama ga̱hi ita esa pa igwadagu. a̱huru u ginbo, kwa di ikanga̱ izaa koce.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Kwa Yesu na kore korwo u lagi na ia̱ ahunda̱, &lt;&lt;Buca abumui, su zaa ma ia̱gi kwa na so miya ma adanda na, ina goo bu ginbo a i.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Nga̱ bware buba maringe kwa na bangi ga na malabo, zwama malabo ma konbe ga dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Kwa bware curya ga kwa kore u taculana ia̱ ahunda̱, na hin ina buba zwamago. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Kwa Yesu na maringe pa silmajiri sa bware kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Isiyiwa na malabo na uhunpacu? Byana, lokaci u yabtano, ai cutana Bwa bu Buwama na wa aco magwata̱. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Masingeji ci mu ali! Buna bu ka̱ri na cutan bu kurya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A̱ konbe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yesu eba na cikarigo,Yahuda, ina i yiwa pa silmajiri ikope na sirya̱, i wucya. Bu kurya na aco dinyiya tiganba kasakari na sigungu, a sirya pa bulabe bulabe na onga aco. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Buna bui cutan bware bu rigyano bwa zwamanaga alama na buba bui ciba a daki: &lt;&lt;Buna bu gya ni sunban; i kumbe bwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Bu kore na cika̱ pa Yesu, kwa Yahuda ni hin, &lt;&lt;Na bu sanganu, Walami!&gt;&gt; Na wunsuman bware.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;A'usa, ia̱ga ina ya bu kule.&gt;&gt; Kwa aco na ali, na konbe Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Nga̱ ab hyan ina i, kwa almajiri a Yesu ni zacige kasakari na supi bugyama bulabe bulabe, hal bu gunji bu cubi. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />&lt;&lt;Ringya kasakari na suwa u pucu u ba,&gt;&gt; Yesu i hin na buba, &lt;&lt;Buna bu silacume kasakari bui kwaji pa kasakari. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Idakuwo na pwan i oga Buca abumui, buzaa i sana buna cumagiya bataliya ikope na harya acuma a Hwinsu? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Niya cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba ci sinji cina caba kargyago an harbuni iba i ia̱ga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Kwa Yesu na hin na aco na matanga, &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi i kore na kasakari na sigungu zwama i na konbe? Tohonba si madale na yaba ahunda̱ na cibaga, hinda i na kunbuwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />A ia̱gi uni ka̱mu zwama a sinji ina acubago a Hwinsu aba rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu,&gt;&gt; Kwa silmajiri sa bware na sume bware kwa na ma alana.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu pa majalisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />A̱co na konbe Yesu a kole bware pa Kayapa, bulabe bulabe, ihuga̱ ina hawalami han ha cibago cikarigo ci Musa na onga an matanaga. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Hinda Bitrus na lagan ga ciyabu, korwo suwa u yaba pa ukaba una aba ginbo ia̱gi yasu sharia na bulabe bu yaba ahunda̱. Bware bu ese kwa na madala na aco a̱pe bu hyan ina i ia̱ga na Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Ka̱mu aco majalisa ma bulabe bu yaba ahunda̱ a ginbage yina una aba ai konbe Yesu na magwata̱ nga̱ aba ai hya yina aba ai hone bware. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Hinda ai hinwo, kwa di panu sheda una cibya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:60">Kwa di aco barya a kurya na kacuta̱ <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />hinda a hyan, &lt;&lt;Buco buna bu hyan, &lt;Na pwan ihuzi yaba ahunda̱ i Hwinsu hinda gupe ema na mohon mutaco.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Kwa bulabe bulabe na masinga na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buzaa i cane? Cimba cikarigo caba yiwa na kulage zwam goo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Hinda Yesu i cane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:63">Kwa bulabe bulabe na hin na bware.&gt;&gt; Na bu gami na Hwinsu buna bu zi a̱huru na zaa ihogu: Ci zwamanya si gabui busa kristi, bwa bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;Harbuni, nga̱ goo bo zwame, &lt;&lt;Hinda na zwama ka̱mu nuhi: Daga bane, I hyan Bwa bu Buwama bu madale na wa u cuga na koce, u Buhuzi bu doone na maringe zata uhalalan ha zaro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Kwa bulabe bulabe na hanje cilapo na hin, &lt;&lt;Bu cwane Hwinsu! be ga̱ci ginbago sheda wa aco? Byana, bane ga̱hi i hoge i cwane Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />be ga̱hi hya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">&lt;&lt;Bo jobe uo,&gt;&gt; a cane.<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Kwa na cwana bware hatanbi na sino kwa na ita bware igucu. Acagiya aco a mare bware<verse eid="MAT 26:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Na hin, &lt;&lt;Ci zwamanya ina i ia̱ ni ga̱ci, si busa Kristi. Ga bu supi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bitrus a hin ai dakuwo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Baniya Bitrus a madale na ijapu i yaba, bugyama bu ikangaza kwa ni kurya pa bware. &lt;&lt;Goo ma bu yiwa tare ni Yesu buco bu Galili,&gt;&gt; i hin.<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Kwa Bitrus na hin naba ka̱mu. &lt;&lt;Ni dakuwo ina goo bu yiwa na zwamaga,&gt;&gt; bware bu hin.<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Kwa Bitrus ne sire pa eba, kwa ikangaza imewa ni hin bware kwa eba na zwaman aco payi, &lt;&lt;Buco buna bu yiwa na Yesu ina i Nazaret.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Kwa Bitrus na hin an bui dakuwo hal bu macune: &lt;&lt;Na dakuwo buco buna!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />I sani cimu, aco a kore pa Bitrus kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda goo ma bu yiwa tare naba, ni zwama cikarigo acibui cibu cibe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Kwa Bitrus na hinan na macunag, &lt;&lt;Nai dakuwo buco buna!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Kwa uka̱ri na ugan. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Kwa Bitrus ni mabutaryage cikarigo ci Yesu aba zwamage: &lt;&lt;Ubungwa uzaa bonge uka̱ri we ugana bui hyan ana bui na dakuwo hal kurwa u taco.&gt;&gt; Kwa Bitrus na sere ni ijapu bu dare dinyiya.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">yahuda i hone icwa eba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Ubung ma'inta bulabe bu yaba ahunda̱ na onga aco a matanaga kwa ni ia̱ga shawara a hone Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />A pare Yesu kwa ni zangi bware, Kwa ni kula bware hwa Gomna Bilatus. <verse eid="MAT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Nga̱ Yahuda, Ina i cuta Yesu , ibe hyan a rigano a hune Yesu, kwa yama ni kumbe Yahuda dinyiya, hinda kwa bware ni zangi musare muna mu apano bware, shekel kupe ataco, kwa bware ni ringagya alabe alabe ni onga aco. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />&lt;&lt;Ni ia̱ magwata̱,&gt;&gt; bware bu hin, &lt;&lt;Ni zwama ni cutana mahya ma buco buna bu zaa magwata̱,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ini isa be ahwaci?&gt;&gt; a cane. &lt;&lt;Ibwana nubui bini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Kwa Yahuda ni kwamana musare na suwa yaba ahunda̱ kwa ni mawalan. Kwa bware ni kore kwa ni hone icwa i buba. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Kwa bulabe bu yaba ahunda̱ ni zangaca musare muni kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Ui kamacuwa a tanane musare muni na ihuga̱ i ci'iru ui yaba ahunda̱, Zwam musa musare ma mahya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Kwa aba ni ia̱gi shawara kwa ni sa ihuga̱ i buco bu ma ia̱ sitako ihuga̱ ina aba iwumbugano hanyagata si ha kwaji. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ubi usa aba zane hugani ize cinge ci mahya. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Zwama a sinji ina acubago Hwinsu Irmiya buba hin: &lt;&lt;A zangi azurpa kope hataco, Musare muni mu aco Isra'ila bu yaja ani aba cupe bware, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />hinda kwa aba ni san ihuga̱ i buco bu ma ia̱ sitako ihuga̱ ina aba iwumbugano hanyagata si ha kwaji, nga̱ Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu buba ani a iyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kule Yesu pa Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Kwa Yesu i yisa pa Gwamna, kwa Gwamna ni kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;Gabui busa bugwama bu Yahudawa?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Harbuni, nga̱ goo bu zwame,&gt;&gt; Yesu i cane. <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />nga̱ alabe alabe ni unga aba ia̱gi bware cibya bware bu ca nyaga. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Bilatus kwa ni kaba̱ bware, &lt;&lt;Bui huguwa ina aco ni zwamaga ani bu iyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Yesu i cane ga, ko cikarigo cinka Gwamna kwa ni huge mamaki dinyiya. <verse eid="MAT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Tuhumba lago ikacikago gwamna si curi buca buika̱ buna bwa gunja buna bu aco uba yaji. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Na huni azaa buna bu abu gundiga na yaba ci'incu, ize buba Barabbas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Nga̱ aco aba matanaga, Bilatus kwa ni kaba̱ naga, &lt;&lt;Gamba gahi gimba gya gunjagya: Barabbas ko Yesu ina eba ni uge Kristi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Zwam Bilatus bu daki an a cuta Yesu zwama dabe soo na bware. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Kwa Bilatus imadale na idalo i mugwamgwam, bu'a bu bware bu cuma pa bware: &lt;&lt;Ta yada tane wa na buco buce buna buzaa magwata̱, ni zwama ni gita nawuya ani pan wahala dinyiya ni halabuwa zwama buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Kwa alabe alabe na onga a san aco a kaba̱ ani agunjiya Barabbas aba hone Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />&lt;&lt;Aco na barya gamba bu ga̱hi bu gimba gya curi gwamna u kaba̱. &lt;&lt;Barabbas,&gt;&gt; A cane. <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />&lt;&lt;Beya gya ni ia̱ga, baniya ni Yesu ini aba i uga Kristi?&gt;&gt; Bilatus a kaba̱. A cane ka̱mu, &lt;&lt;A jukai bware!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />&lt;&lt;Beya sa iri wamba magwata̱ buba iyi,&gt;&gt; Bilatus a kaba̱ kwa aba ni jidana danda bicwarwa, &lt;&lt;A jukai bware!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Nga̱ Bilatus aba hyan azaa ini pwan ia̱, hinda aco hina gimba yi yasinga soo, kwa bware ni zangi miyi kwa ni guzagi siwa pa haisa ha aco. kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Ni dakuwo ihya zwama mahya ma buca buna bware bu hin. &lt;&lt;Isa ibwana nuhi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Kwa aco ni cane ka̱mu, &lt;&lt;Mahya ma bware maya ni sicwa asici na sawoo asici!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Kwa bware ni gunjagiga Barabbas. Kwa bware ni ia̱gya Yesu bulala kwa ni cutaniga Yesu a jukai bware.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu soja mu same Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Kwa mu soja mu gwamna mu zangi Yesu korwo iginga kwa ni tanaga mucage mu soja kwa ni ringani Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Aba ni bwajiga bware hazunga kwa ni bwadan bware cilapo cina ci nyaga ni cilapo ci cugwama, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Kwa ni ia̱gya bware naji u kware kwa ni bwadan bware ni icwa. Kwa ni pan bware agungu ana a nyaga ni agungu a cugwama kwa ni kuztan bware ni same bware. &lt;&lt;Hwinsu uba mujidana mohon bugwama bu Yahudawa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Kwa ni cwane bware hatambi, Kwa ni ca bware agungu ana aba pa bware kwa ni hinan supiaga bware ni aba. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />nga̱ aba hogi ia̱gya bware alala, kwa na bwajiga bware cilapo ci cugwama kwa na ringya ibwadana cilapo ci bware kwa na ala na bware ihuga̱ ina aba a jukai bware.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">A jukai Yesu zata u'on</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Aba na cihano kwa aba na magama na buco bu Sayirin, muna aba ugo saminu. Asa bware dole bu zangi u'on masacu na aba kore jukai Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />A kurya ihuga̱ ina aba uga Golgota, (Ma'ana ma iba ha upa hai icwa). <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />A pan Yesu ubono una swin bu so, mana mahitagi na ihya ina i sungore, nga̱ bware buba hurpa̱, bware bu wanje so. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Nga̱ aba kamga bware hakusa kwa na jukai bware na u'on masacu, kwa aba na mahapsaga cilapo ci bware na mabyana. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />A madale, aba na gingyaga bware <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Zata ni icwa i bware, aba i hin rubuto laipi a bware: <char style="sc" closed="false">YESU BANI BUGWAMA BU YAHUDAWA</char><verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />A jukai Yesu na a'hya barya, buika̱ na wa u cuga buika̱ na wa ugule. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Aco na yiwa na ala aba na cwa bware, aba na jumaga sicwa saba na ia̱ga bware alala. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Aba na zwamaga, &lt;&lt;Goo buna bu ka̱ri i huzi yaba ahunda̱ goo ima hwa na mohon mutaco, ceci icwa nibui! Kazingya zata na u'on masacu, sa busa Bwa bu Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Harbuni hinda alabe alabe, hawalami ha mutakada Musa, a unga labe a hina na ia̱gana bware alala. <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />&lt;&lt;Bware bu ce cagiya aco,&gt;&gt; aba hin, &lt;&lt;Bware bui panuwa caga icwa i bware! Bware busa bugwama bu Isra'ila! bware bu kanzigya baniya zata na u'on masacu, a paniya ga̱ci ci yaje na bware. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Bware bu yaje na Hwinsu, curi Hwinsu wa cagage bware baniya si uka̱ri bware, zwam u hin, &lt;&lt;Gyamui nisa Bwa bu Hwinsu. <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Harbuni hinda a hin an aba jukaiga tare na bware ama ia̱gi bware alala.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikwaju I Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Tun na hwinsu na icwa, korwo uyumbe i huga ya siriwa ka̱mu na cinge. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Nga̱ awa tanasi aba wuci Yesu a sana ci uga, &lt;&lt;Elohi, Elohi, lamasabatani? wato, Hwinsu numui, Hwinsu numui, be san goo buna pan kacuta̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Aco na isa ciyabu na yinsa ciyabu na Bware nga̱ aba huge, kwa aba na hin, &lt;&lt;Bware bu yiwa na uge Iliya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Kwa bucahya na mahaguzana kwa buba na yamana munda kwa na zangi usoso. kwa buba na cupe agungu na maro mana ma songore, bu pa bware bu so, <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Acagiya aco an hin &lt;&lt;Baniya curi bware i sana ca hyan ko Iliya i korya ceci bware. <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yesu a jidana san cu'ogo dinyiya, kwa bware na curya a̱huru bware. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ai sanuwo paniya kwa ulapo ui kubtaganu we yaba ahunda̱ umahaje na zata korwo wime cinge ci ma jumu hagandaro hal ma mapupsagi. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Kwa aba na sirya pa Muzin mana ma hakanga ha aco nagu ciri a masingya. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Asilage na hazin haba, kwa Yesu na masinguwa pa u'on a ese mu'ogo mu nagu magwata̱ hinda aco dinyiya hina na hyanagaga. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Nga̱ isoja i labe bu a̱pe bu bware buba na aco na yiwa na a̱pe Yesu aba hin cinge ci ma jumiye na ini ya pare ka̱mu, kwa iwasa na kumbega, kwa aba na hin, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda Buco muna busa Bwa bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Si'a dinyiya sa yiwa aba na ginge cimere. Kwa aba na laga Yesu kurwo Galili aba na yega ka̱mu ina bware buba gimbago. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Ciki waba Imaryamu Magadalin, na amaci a Yakub na Yusuf saawo si Zabadi.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwubanu i Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Uyimbe wa kurya yi wuci, kwa bucahya buna buzaa izana ize buba Yusuf una wa Arimatiya, bware buba busa silmajiri si Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Kwa bware na kore pa Bilatus, bware bu kaba̱ ikanga̱ i Yesu, Bilatus kwa na pan bware ikanga̱ i Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusuf zangi ikanga̱ i Yesu, kwa bware na nadi nya̱ na ulapo u burya̠ , <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Bware kwa na iri ikanga̱ na izin ipun i bware ina bware buba bu sabe pa ikanga̱ i tare kwa ne subka tare na unu u izin kwa na mawalan. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Imaryamu Magadalin na cagiya Imaryamu ciyabu na izin aba na gingyaga izin. <verse eid="MAT 27:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />A a̱pe izin ubungwa ne bongya, hon Asabar u ali,bulabe bulabe na Haparisiyawa a kore pa Bilatus. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />&lt;&lt;Buca bulabe,&gt;&gt; aba hin, &lt;&lt;Ci mabutaragwa nga̱ buna bu yiwa na san aco a iyi magwata̱ bware buba yiwa na a̱huru bu hin, bayan hun tacula ni masingya pa aco na kwadaga. <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Zwama harbuni sana a a̱pa izin kwa mohon mutaco mu ali. Ibe i sana, silmajiri si pwana i kore si hya ikanga̱ i bware aba kore zwama aco ana bware bu masinge zwama cibya ci kacuta̱ ci zake cina jigu. <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />&lt;&lt;Bilatus u cane ga zangaje aco a̱pe.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kulaje, i a̱pa, izin ini na burya̠ nga̱ ga̱hi i pona.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Kwa aba na kore, ne kubta̱ izin kwa aba na iri aco a̱pe.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">U wasunguwo Yesu pa u'oh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Nga̠ Asabar ab ali, na ubungwa ma'inta-ma'inta hon jigu mako, Imaryamu Magadalin na cagiya Imaryamu a kore zwama a byana izin. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />A iyi ijumu i cinge dinyiya; zwama acuma a Hwinsu a kanzigya zata zaro, ma'ali pa izin kwa na swabka tare, kwa na madala zata. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Siro u Bware u nyaga na imazki-imazki, cilapo ci bware ci cine nga̠ ciza <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Aco na yiwa na a̠pe a hoge iwasa hal a hina idagalag nga̠ aco na kwaji. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Kwa acuma Hwinsu ne hin na si'a, &lt;&lt;Ita huga iwasa,&gt;&gt; bu hin. &lt;&lt;zwama na daki i yiwa na gimbo u Yesu, ana aba jukai zata u'on u masacu. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Bware buzaa piniya; bu masingo, nga̱ bware buba zwame. Kuryaje i hyan pa aba labtise bware. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Hinda mahaguza je na monda baniya, i zwama silmajiri si bware, &lt;Bware bu masingo pa aco kwajo, hinda bware bui sanga na kurwa u Galili; apayi ga̱hi i hyan bware!&gt; mabutaryage ina gya na zwama. &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Kwa si'a na mahaguzan na curi hazin hani, aba na iwasa na wa̱wo dinyiya kwa aba na kore na munda pa silmajiri. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />I sanuwo kwa Yesu na bangiga. &lt;&lt;Sanuje,&gt;&gt; bware bu hin. Aba kwa na kore pa bware a pan bware cilabe. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Kwa Yesu na hyan naba, &lt;&lt;Ita huga iwasa. kulaje i zwama buhun nimui, a kore na Galili; ahwayo aba ai na hyan gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aco a̱pe hazin a kuliye ruhoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Si'a siba na yina uringuwa, Aco a̱pe iziya kwa aba na ese na i'ogo kwa na zwama bulabe bulabe ina ia̱gi ka̱mu. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Nga̱ alabe alabe aba madale na onga kwa na zwamana musoja mu magalagana, kwa na pan mu musare dinyiya, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />i zwaman ga, &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi i hin, &lt;Silmajiri si bware sibiya sa kurya na gita na hya bware ga̱ci na malabo.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Si ruhoto una kore pa Gwamna, bui yaje na ga̱ci zwama bo ci silacome pa wahala.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Kwa musoja na ca musare, hinda na ia̱ga ina aba zwamaga. Hinda cikarigo cini harbuniyo aba hogi i zwamaga ca na cinge ci Hayahudawa hal kurwa nawuya.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cicuma cilabe ci Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Silmajiri kupe na sika si ali korwo Galili pa nga̱ i ugo na Yesu iba zwamaga na <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />nga̱ aba hyan Yesu, kwa na pan bware cilabe; Ama cagiya ama yajuwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Kwa Yesu na kore paba na hin, buca abumui na zaro buni pa &lt;&lt;Ka̱mu koce na zaro, na cinge an panu. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Zwama harbuniyo kulaje i san aco sana silmajiri asimui si mu'ogo ka̱mu, ia̱gi ga Baptisma na ize Buca na Bwa na a̱huru a burya̠ , <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Na cibagi ga a laga ka̱mu ina hin naba. Ka̱mu hinda nayuwa na ga̱hi tahomba lokaci, hal ihogu u doone.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>